<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Noyoy Ēwē Veg Tigsas Kraēs Mak Mayap</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="rem">advisor by Michael Smith. Check completed 17 June 2015.</para>
  <para style="mt">Noyoy Ēwē Veg Tigsas Kraēs Mak Mayap</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Jon Vavasugyon̄ nitoytoy n̄a lepnō vadalm̄eg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Igōhkē noyoy ēwē veg Tigsas Kraēs, ikē Ēntēn Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Net lēgēlgēg Isaya mavap vasem tō me veg kē, a Ḡod mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">Net gōh bavanvan tēy nohohole mino.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">No tēvētleg kē me am̄ag so niak tēytēymat namtehal hiy nēk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Malachi 3:1</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Kē niōlōl n̄a lepnō vadalm̄eg, kē niōlōl so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">“Atmi ak tēytēymat namtehal veg Welan nongēn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Atmi m̄ōgteg galsi ba ak tenenen namtehal susu del veg kē.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 40:3</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Tō me atgiy en, Jon nivan me lepnō vadalm̄eg nen, tō niqtēg vavasugyon̄, wa nitoytoy hiy nisil. Tō kē mavap so, “Atmi leh nēdēmdēm nonmi den negengenyeg del nonmi bastō vasugyon̄ kimi tō Ḡod nidēmveteg nubug nonmi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Tō nisil del vel vōnō susu a Judea tiwag mi ige sil n̄a Jerusalem, kēy van tō yon̄teg notoytoy nonon. Bastō kēy ōlbug, tō kē nivasugyon̄ kēy Lēbē Lon̄ Jordan.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Namalmal non Jon en mak mi nili kamel. Tō nogoytig nonon en mak mi nivin bōlōk. Ba negengen nagan, nemen titikey ba nusuk ne sukabak.<verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Jon mavap van hiy ige sil so, “Net vitwag sisqet nivan me, ba kē nilwo yeh den no. Nok et haytēyēh te so van me net mugumgu nonon. Wa nok et sey te so taqhiy hōw so tuwyak nasandol nonon den nayn̄on. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nok vasugyon̄ kimi mi nēbē ēwē, ba kē qoyo vasugyon̄ kimi mi Nuvu Yon̄.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon nivasugyon̄ Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Lōqōn̄ vitwag, Tigsas mavan me den Nasaret a Kalili, tō Jon nivasugyon̄ kē Lēbē Lon̄ Jordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Mahē a Tigsas mat kal me den nēbē en, kē met nōtōq mawak, wa Nuvu Yon̄ non Ḡod mēhēw tēqēl me hiy kē qeleso noqon. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ba Ḡod mohole tēqēl me hiy kē mavap so, “Inēk Intik a no nitiy tam nēk. No nemlaklak yeh hiy nēk.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satan nim̄eygal Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Et misin te Nuvu Yon̄ mēvētleg Tigsas tō kē nivan lepnō vadalm̄eg. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Kē motog lepnō vadalm̄eg nōqōn̄ son̄wul vet, tō Satan mem̄eygal kē. Tigsas motog tiwag mi nahaphap tuytuy del, ba ige in̄sel metgoy wawah kē.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas niqtēg namgumgu namun n̄a Kalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Lēkle qōn̄ a Herod Antipas mētēy Jon Vasugyon̄ tō mōm̄ōk bat kē lēm̄ yētyēt en, Tigsas mavan me Kalili tō meqtēg toytoy Noyoy Ēwē non Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Tigsas motoytoy so, “Nōqōn̄ mal nognog ēgēn. Nōqōn̄ a Ḡod so nimyanag goy ige sil lemyam mal van sisqet me. Atmi dēmleh den negengenyeg del nonmi, ba dēmtig Noyoy Ēwē.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mōlōl ige bulvet a ige vōn̄ōpn̄ōn mōmō</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Mahē a Tigsas mavan me sili bē liwo, ōl so Lēbē Kalili, kē metsas yoge vōyō, Simon kōyō ēthēn a Andrō. Kōyō suwsuwyeg qen, veg kōyō net vōn̄ōpn̄ōn mōmō. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kōyō so, “Atmōyō dam no, kōmyō van me net mino. Tō nok vatne kōmyō tavan me net vōn̄ōpn̄ōn ige et.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Tigsas mohohole bah van hiy kōyō en, tō vag tiwag ēwē kōyō hatig veteg neqen noyō, tō kōyō dam tatag kē.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Tigsas et van yeh qete wah, kē nietsas yoge yantēntēn Sēbēdē, nahayō Jemes ba Jon. Kōyō nahag lelo bō-ōt nonoy, wonwon neqen noyō. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Tō Tigsas mōl kōyō vagtiwag ēwē, tō kōyō van veteg imam noyō hagtō lōbō-ōt tiwag mi ige et mugumgu nonon, wa kōyō dam tatag Tigsas.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mōvōy yak nuvu het den net vitwag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon mavan me Kapaniam. Tō totogyeg a Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg kē nihayveg hay lēm̄ tatay nonoy wa nivatvatne ige sil. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Tō ige mey a kēy moyon̄teg nohohole nonon en, kēy mamamakē aē veg nohohole nonon naman aē, et qele te nohohole non ige vatvatgo Bele. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Lamahē nen, net vitwag mahayveg hay me lēm̄ tatay, ba net nan, nuvu het mēhēw kē. <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />Tō kē mōltaw a nēkēkēn ba mavap so, “!Tigsas Tanasaret! ?Wō nēk van me so akteg kemem? ?Nēk so ak hethet kemem, ah? Ba no mal ēglal nēk. !Inēk gōh, Nitiy Et Yon̄ non Ḡod!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Ba Tigsas mohole maymay van hiy nuvu het nan, wa mavap so, “!Ēy, nitog hohole! !Kalō den kē!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Tō nuvu het nan mak nataqn̄ēn meyeyey a meyeyey, tō kē mōltaw a nēkēkēn, tō nuvu het nan nikalō den kē.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ige del mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn, tō kēy mēvēvēhge kēy wo, “?Ēy, wō nahap qele gōh? !Net gōh nohohole nonon negyaq! Ba naman nonon aē, mahē a kē nihole van hiy nuvu het en, kēy yon̄teg kē.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Et su misin hōn te, noyoy veg Tigsas maga walēg vel vōnō del n̄a Kalili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas niak wē woqse et gom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Mahē a Tigsas tiwag mi Jemes, wa Jon, wa Simon wa Andrō, kēy makalō me den nēm̄ tatay en, kēy van tasga n̄a lēm̄ non Simon kōyō Andrō. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Ba mahē a kēy kalbat me lēm̄ nen, ige lelo ēm̄ en mavasemlō van hiy Tigsas so qēlgan Simon mey nalqōvēn entō letno tamge nonon, veg kē mogom, nogom momyiy maqal kē. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Tō Tigsas mavan me hiy kē, wa mētēy namnen tō niyaphatig kē hag nen, tō nogom momyiy nibah den kē, tō kē nilep me negengen hiy kēy ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Lemyēpyep, mahē a nalo mal yoy vatag, ige a nogom tiwag mi ige a nuvu het mēhēw kēy en, ige nonoy vantēy kēy me hiy Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ige del lelo vōnō nen mavan tiwag me lemte-ēm̄ vitwag a me aslil. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Tō Tigsas mak wē woqse et a nogom tegtegha maqal tō kēy, tō kēy mēwē qēt lokse. Wa tō kē mōvōy yakyak nuvu het del den woqse et. Ba kē et ukēg te so ige vu het so hohole, veg kēy mal ēglal vatag kē.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nitoytoy n̄a Kalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Lemtap qōn̄qōn̄ lapgetō, Tigsas mahatig, tō makalō aslil, kē mavan mahē a net tateh aē, tō kē nitatay. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Me atgiy, Simon tiwag mi ige yaplōplōn van tō sok kē. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Kēy metsas kē nen, tō kēy mavap van hiy kē so, “Ige del soksok nēk.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Itōk so gēn van lepnō tegtegha geh me gōh, tō nok so toytoy van hiy kēy, veg no mavan me so ak namgumgu agōh.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Tō kē mavan heylō me vel vōnō n̄a Kalili, tō motoytoy hiy kēy lēm̄ tatay nonoy, wa tō kē mōvōyyakyak nuvu het den kēy.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mak wē net wēyēs vitwag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Net vitwag a nēwēyēs, kē mavan me met Tigsas, tō kē mavatiqaw hōw lengon wa mēvēhge kē so nimyin̄ kē. Kē wo, “Ēy, so nēk wo nemyōs, tō nēk tak wenwen vēh no.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Ba Tigsas memgaysēn yeh kē, tō mōm̄ōk namnen apwon ba mavap van hiy kē so, “O-oh, no nemyōs. !Nēk wenwen lok!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Tō nogom nonon nibah ganwon, tō nataqn̄ēn niwenwen lok. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43-44" />Tō Tigsas nihole maymay van hiy kē, tō mavap so, “Nēk nitog vavasemlō nahap a no mak tō van hiy nēk en. Ba nēk van hiy nipris ba kē niet galgalsi so nataqn̄i mēwē. Wa nēk van ba mogmogo goy Ḡod wa lep nolol namu van hiy Ḡod qele Nele non Mosis mavayēg tō aē, ak tō ige sil ēglal so nogom nōnōm mal bah wa nēk mal wenwen lok.” Kē mohole bah en, tō kē nivētleg kē tō nivan. <verse eid="MRK 1:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ba kē et yon̄teg te, kē mavan mohoyhoy lō noyoy gōh, ak tō so Tigsas tit van vēhte lelo vōnō a lengon ige sil. Ba Tigsas motog ēwē aslil a lepnō vadalm̄eg, tō ige vel vōnō mosoksok kē.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Team checked to here with Steve Wes and Norris. 11 October 2024</para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas mak wē net gom vitwag a nayn̄on vōyō namat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Tigsas mavan dēn̄ lok me lepnō Kapaniam, a yatkel qōn̄ mal van. Tō ige sil moyon̄teg noyoy nonon so ikē n̄a lēm̄ nonon. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Tō woqse et mavan me lēm̄ nan, ba nēm̄ nan nōyheg et, tō kēy et hayveg qēt te lēm̄. Ba nam̄adeg den kēy mataq goy namte-ēm̄. Tō Tigsas nitoytoy nohohole nonon van hiy kēy. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Kē hohole lapgetō en, tō ige bulvet hah me net gom vitwag a nayn̄on vōyō namat. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ba kēy et van sisqet te Tigsas, veg nēm̄ nan nōyheg et. Tō kēy meyem kal hag lēkle-ēm̄, wa mak namtem̄lō liwo hag lēkle-ēm̄ en, togolgol apwon Tigsas. Mahē kēy mak bah namtem̄lō lēkle-ēm̄ en, tō kēy voyoy tēqēl kē hōw a kē nen letno tamge nonon. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Tigsas met nēdēmtig nonoy namaymay en, tō kē mavap van hiy net gom nan so, “Intik, nubug del nōnōm, no mal dēmveteg qēt.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ba yatkel vatvatgo Bele hag gehtō lelo ēm̄ en, kēy dēmdēm yoyon̄ mahgey so, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“?Qeleave tō net gōh nihohole qele gōh? !Nohohole gōh nehet! Kē tak hethet vēh nahan Ḡod, veg Ḡod mahgen te dēmveteg vēh nubug non net.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Vagtiwag ēwē Tigsas mēglal nēdēmdēm nonoy, tō nivap van hiy kēy wo, “?Bahap tō kimi dēmdēm hethet qelenen? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />?Mey qeleave netwoyig so vap van hiy net gom gōh, ‘Nubug nōnōm mal dēmveteg qēt,’ si so, ‘Nēk hatig, lep natamge nōnōm, ba m̄ōl’?<verse eid="MRK 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />“Ba no nemyōs so kimi ēglal so Ninti Et, naman nonon aē lemyam gōh so tēdēmveteg vēh nubug non net.” Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy net gom nen so, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nok vap van hiy nēk so, hatig, lep natamge nōnōm, ba m̄ōl.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Vagtiwag ēwē, net gom nan mahatig, melep natamge nonon lengoy del, tō nivan. Ige del mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn, tō kēy mōlwē Ḡod, ba mavap so, “!Meqtēg yak te tō me en, gēn etet qete nahap vitwag qele agōh!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mōlōl Levi so nitatag kē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Tigsas mavan tēqēl lokse yow sili bē liwo Kalili, tō woqse sil mavan me hiy kē, tō kē nivatne kēy. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Mahē kē nivan malig hag, kē netsas Levi, ēntēn Alfeus. Net nan, ikē net bēvēlvēl sēm batakis. Kē nahag a lelo ēm̄ mugumgu nonon. Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “Nēk dam tatag no.” Tō kē nihatig tō nidam kē ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Me atgiy Tigsas mavan begengen a lēm̄ non Levi. Ba woqse et bēvēlvēl sēm batakis, tiwag mi ige gengenyeg, ikēy del megengen tiwag mi Tigsas wa ige tin̄qoy nonon, veg woqse sil madam tatag Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Yatkel vatvatgo ne Le, a kēy Nafarisi ōk, kēy met so Tigsas megengen tiwag mi ige gengenyeg wa tiwag mi ige bēvēlvēl sēm batakis. Tō kēy vēhge van hiy ige tin̄qoy nonon wo, “?Bahap tō Tigsas nigengen tiwag mi ige bēvēlvēl sēm batakis wa ige gengenyeg nen?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Tigsas moyon̄teg nohohole nonoy en, tō kē mavap van hiy kēy so, “Net a et gom te en, kē tit mōyōs vēhte notokta. Ba net a nogom en, kē nemyōs notokta. Tō nok et van te me so ōlōl ige tenenen. Ba nok van me so ōlōl ige gengenyeg so kēy dam no.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēvēvēhiy bagaygaymamah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Lamahē nen, ige yowyowveg non Jon Vasugyon̄ wa ige Farisi, kēy gaygaymamah batatay. Ba yatkel et mavan me ba mēvēhge Tigsas wo, “?Qeleave? ?Ige non Jon wa ige Farisi, kēy gaygaymamah batatay, ba tō ige yowyowveg nōnōm et gaygay mamah temuy te bahap?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Ba Tigsas meplu goy kēy wo, “?Vētmahē a net mey meleg gayaq tō tog lapgetō legengen liwo tiwag mi ige sil nonon en, kimi dēm van so ige nonon tagaygaymamah vēh? !Tateh! Mahē a kē notog lapgetō mi kēy en, kēy tit gaygaymamah vēhte. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ba mahē vanvan lapgetō me, a ige tavale telepyak kē den ige yapluplun en, tō lamahē nen, kēy qoyo gaygaymamah ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Tateh et telep natvēl malmal gayaq, so niwongoy namtem̄lō ne malmal saq nonon aē. So kē wo mak qelenen tō natvēl malmal gayaq nen tak mahay yeh namalmal saq nonon, tō namtem̄lō nan nitiy liwo yeh. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ba tateh et so nilep nawaen gayaq ba so nipdin lowobē tēnēte.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ige Juw mak tō nowobē mi nipni nani. Mahē nawaen gayaq, kē nisis woy qeleso nis. Sowo nowobē et maymay te, kē nilōwyeg.</char></note> So net wo mak qelenen en, nawaen gayaq nan tisiswoy nōwōbē tō nimwoy hethet tō nawaen nilōwyeg qēt. Ba nawaen gayaq en, net tepdin ēwē vēh lowobē gayaq, tō kē tit siswoy vēhte, wa tō nawaen nan totog galsi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige tin̄qoy non Tigsas mataw niwit a Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg vitwag, Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon mavan heylō me nētqē wit vitwag. Tō ige tin̄qoy nonon mataw yatkel ēwan tō kēy gen. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Tō ige Farisi mavap van hiy Tigsas so, “Ēy, nēk et. Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg, net a niak qelenen, kē niak sisgoy Nele. ?Bahap tō ige nōnōm mak qele gōh?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25-26" />Ba Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi wun et vatah te Layapyap Yon̄, nahaphap a Devēt mak tō am̄ag. Mahē nen, Abiata, ikē nam̄agoy ige pris. Ba namaygay mak Devēt tiwag mi ige nonon kēy veg negengen nagay mabah. Tō Devēt nihayveg hay Lēm̄ non Ḡod, tō kē nigen nēbrēyt nen a ige pris mal lep vatag van hiy Ḡod, tō kē melep se van hiy ige nonon tō kēy gen. Ba nēbrēyt nan, Nele vayēg so ige pris mahgey tegen vēh, ba ige et woywoy tit gen vēhte.” <verse eid="MRK 2:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Ḡod mōm̄ōk Nōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg so nimyin̄ ige et, ba kē et m̄ōk te ige et so biyin̄ Nōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Veg bege gōh Ninti Et newelan goy se Nōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Team checked to here with Steve Wes and Norris. 11 October 2024</para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas niak wē lokse namnen net vitwag a Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Lōqōn̄ vitwag se, mahē Tigsas mahayveg hay lēm̄ tatay nen, net vitwag hag tō nen, namnen nehet, kē tit hon̄yeg tenenen vēhte. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ba yatkel et den kēy etet yoyon̄ tō Tigsas en, so kē tak qeleave, kē tak wē vēh net nan Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg si tateh. Veg kēy soksok namtehal a so ak sisgoy kē aē.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy net nan so, “Ēy, nēk van me ba tig me lengon ige sil gēn.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Tō Tigsas nivēhge van hiy kēy wo, “?Nele nongēn vap so gēn so ak qeleave Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg? ?So gēn ak nahaphap mey nēwē, si ak nahaphap mey nehet? ?So vaēh net, si wuhmat net?” Ba kēy et vulu goy te kē. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Tō Tigsas mololgagay, tō metet velvel kēy. Ba kē memgaysēn se kēy, veg nēqtēy namaymay wowoh. Tō kē nivap van hiy net nan so, “Nēk hon̄yeg tenenen namnē.” Tō kē nihon̄yeg tenenen namnen tō niwē. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Me atgiy, ige Farisi makalō, wa muvug tiwag mi ige non Mayanag Herod. Kēy soksok namtehal so kēy tuwuh vēh Tigsas qeleave.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woqse sil madam tatag Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon mavan yak den mahē nen, tō kēy van tēqēl yow lēbē Kalili, ba nisil liwo madam tatag kēy. Nisil gōh mavan me den Kalili, wa mavan me den Judea <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />wa den napnō liwo Jerusalem, wa den nēvēwti vōnō a Idumea, wa den yatkel vōnō tekel bē lon̄ Jordan, wa yatkel vōnō se, sisqet napnō lililwo vōyō, Taya wa Saydon. Ige sil gōh mavan me hiy Tigsas veg kēy moyon̄teg noyoy bahaphap a Tigsas makak geh tō. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9-10" />Tigsas mavaēh woqse et, ak tō so ige del a nogom en, kēy vēyvēy tēmtēm lokse kēy so tan̄qal kē. Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige nonon so kēy tēymat nōbō-ōt vitwag so kē nihag aē, veg kēy tiple vēy tuqutquy van hiy kē. <verse eid="MRK 3:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Wa ige tamat, mahē a kēy met Tigsas en, kēy yowtaq hōw lengon tō gaygayka so, “Inēk gōh Ēntēn Ḡod!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ba Tigsas mohole gatgoy kēy so kēy nitog vavasemlō so ikē ihē.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas metyak ige hal nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Tō Tigsas mavan kal luwutwut vitwag tō mōlōl ige a kē nemyōs tō kēy van me hiy kē. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Kē metyak ige son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō wa mōm̄ōk nahay so ige hal. Kē mōm̄ōk kēy so kēy dam tatag kē, wa tō so nivētleg lō kēy so toytoy Noyoy Ēwē. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Tō kē melep van naman hiy kēy bōvōyvōyyak vu het den net.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Nahan ige son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō gōh wa, Simon, a Tigsas mōl nahan mey negyaq so Pita. <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Wa yohē yantēntēn Sēbēdē, Jemes wa Jon, a Tigsas mōl nahayō mey negyaq so Boanerges (nēdēmdēm nan so ninti len̄vayvay, veg namtevōyō namaymay). <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Wa tō Andrō, Filip, Batholomiw, Mathiw, Tomas, Jemes a ēntēn Alfeus ōk, Tadeus, Simon Silot, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />wa Judas Iskariot, a me atgiy, kē mukēg tō Tigsas van lemnen ige tavale nonon.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yatkel et vap so Tigsas nimgumgu mi naman non Satan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Vētmahē a Tigsas mōm̄ōl lok me lēm̄ tiwag mi ige nonon en, woqse sil mavan lokse me hiy kēy, tō tateh su tekel mahē so kēy so gengen aē. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Mahē a ige nonon tenenen moyon̄teg noyoy veg kē en, kēy van me so lepyak kē, veg ige mavap so kē naqaqa.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ba yatkel vatvatgo Bele mavan tēqēl me den Jerusalem, tō kēy mavap so, “Belsebul, kē notogtog tiwag mi net anen.” Wa tō, “Tigsas melep naman nonon den namyanag non ige vu het nan bōvōyvōyyak vu het.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Tigsas mōlōl me ige nan, wa mavap navap tēngeg van hiy kēy so, “!Satan tit vōyyak vēhte Satan! <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Sowo ige non namyanag vitwag notog vēlwoy, ige tekelgi notog tavale mi ige tavalgi, namgumgu non mayanag nen tit tig vēhte. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ige lēm̄ vitwag, so kēy wo motog vēlwoy, ige nan tit tog galgalsi vēhte. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Tō ige non Satan wo motog tavale lokse mi kēy lokse, tō kēy so tog vēlwoy, tō vel mugumgu non Satan tit tig vēhte, wa tabah. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Tateh et nihayveg lēm̄ non net maymay vitwag so nivēl nahaphap nonon. So kē wo nemyōs so niak qelenen, kē nilēg maymay bah net nan en, tō kē qoyo vēl nahaphap nonon.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Nok vap van hiy kimi nēhēyhēywē. Ḡod tēdēmveteg vēh nubug del a net mak tō, wa vel hohole hethet a net mavap tō hiy kē. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ba net nivap hethet hiy Nuvu Yon̄ en, Ḡod tit dēmveteg vēhte nubug nan, nubug nan notogtog lap qelenen a tit bah vēhte.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Tigsas mohohole qele gōh veg kēy mavap so nuvu a mi Tigsas en, nuvu nan nehet.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige yathēthēn Tigsas wa ige tētētan tiwag mi tita nonon, kēy mavan me so lepyak Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ige yathēthēn Tigsas tiwag mi tita nonon mavan me mahē nen. Ba et hayveg te lēm̄, ba kēy mitig lap aslil. Tō kēy mēvētleg goy Tigsas so kē nivan tō me hiy kēy. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ba woqse sil hag walēg tō Tigsas en, tō kēy vap van hiy kē so, “Ey, tita nōnōm tiwag mi yathithi yow aslil en, kēy nemyōs so et nēk.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ba Tigsas meplu, mavap wo, “?Tita mino tiwag mi ige yathithik ihē?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Tō Tigsas metet ige sil a hag walēg tō kē en, ba mavap so, “Kimi gōh ige tita mino, wa ige yathithik wa ige yatētētek, <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />veg net a niak nahap a Ḡod nemyōs en, tō ikē ithik, tētek wa tita mino.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Team checked to here with Steve Wes and Norris. 11 October 2024</para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavap tēngeg veg net a kē nivavah nōswō wit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Me atgiy Tigsas mavan tēqēl lokse yow sili bē liwo Kalili, tō kē nivatvatne ige sil. Ba veg woqse sil liwo meh mavan me hiy kē en, tō kē me yem yow lōbō-ōt vitwag, tō kē nihaghiy hōw lelo bō-ōt nan. Ba ige sil mataq soloteg me aslil. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Tō Tigsas mavatvatne kēy woqse haphap a lavap tēngeg. Kē mavap so, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Atmi yon̄teg galsi. Net vitwag mavan so nivah niwit lētqē nonon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gēn so vah niwit gōh, gēn suwōy soloteg ēwē tō kēy mōtōw.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Kē meswuy soloteg nōswō wit n̄a lētqē nonon. Tō yatkelgi misisgoy metehal ba ige men van me tō gen qēt. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ba yatkel wit misisgoy lamahē a nevet aē antan, tō kēy memtow togotgo veg nēvētan alge nusu. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ba mahē a nalo nihey maymay meh en, tō nisqo meyen̄ qēt kēy veg nōgōygōyyēn et yow qōqō te. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ba nōswō wit yatkelgi misisgoy lum̄un wolkokon̄ay tō kēy memtow, ba nowolkokon̄ay nan metquy goy kēy tō kēy et ō te nēway. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Ba yatkelgi misisgoy lēvētan mey nēwē, tō kēy memtow galsi, tō milililwo, tō mō nēway, yatkelgi nēway son̄wul tēl, yatkelgi son̄wul levete, wa yatkelgi m̄eldēl.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Tō Tigsas mavap wo, “Nēdēln̄ami wo aē, ba atmi yon̄teg galgalsi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavasemlō so bahap tō kē nivatvatne ige sil mi navap tēngeg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Mahē a Tigsas nahag mahgen, yatkel et moyon̄teg tō nohohole nonon tiwag mi ige son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō mavan me, mēvēhge kē so niōwtam̄ow nēdēmdēm nevap tēngeg a kē mavap tō. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Nok hole m̄ōleg van hiy kimi, nohohole lōn̄veg mey a Ḡod namyanag goy ige sil nonon. Ba ige mey a kēy notog aslil en, no tohohole van hiy kēy mi navap tēngeg vēlēs, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />tō so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Kēy et, et, et, ba tit et vēglal vēhte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">tō kēy yon̄teg, yon̄teg, yon̄teg, ba tit yon̄teg vēglal vēhte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">So kēy wo moyon̄teg vēglal en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">tō kēy teleh vēh nēdēmdēm nonoy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">tō Ḡod tēdēmveteg nubug nonoy.’ ” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 6:9-10</char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavasemlō nēdēmdēm ne vap tēngeg beswō wit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy wo, “?Qeleave? ?Kimi et ēglal qete navap tēngeg gōh? ?Sowo qelenen, tō kimi tēglal qeleave yatkel vap tēngeg? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Net a mavah nōswō wit en, ikē qeleso net a nivasemlō nohohole non Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Yatkel et qele nōswō wit a misisgoy lemtehal. Mahē a kēy moyon̄teg bah Noyoy Ēwē nen en, tō Satan nivan me tō nilepyak nohohole nen den kēy.<verse eid="MRK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />“Yatkel et qele niwit a misisgoy lēvētan a nevet aē antan. Mahē a kēy moyon̄teg Noyoy Ēwē en, tō kēy mēdēmtig mi namlaklak liwo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ba nohohole nen et hayveg galsi te van lēdēmdēm nonoy, tō nohohole et tog misin te. Mahē kēy tog lememeh si ige hohole hethet hiy kēy boyoy ēwē gōh, tō kēy ukēg veteg nowmat.<verse eid="MRK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />“Yatkel et qele nōswō wit a misisgoy lum̄un wolkokon̄ay. Ige gōh, kēy yon̄teg Noyoy Ēwē, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ba kēy dēmdēm vēlēs bēh nonoy telemyam. Kēy nemyōs so m̄eye haphap, wa kēy nemyōs yatkel haphap tegtegha se. Ba vel haphap geh gōh, titigoy Noyoy Ēwē gōh, tō tateh ēway geh lēh nonoy.<verse eid="MRK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />“Ba ige yatkelgi, ikēy qele nōswō wit a misisgoy lēvētan ēwē. Kēy moyon̄teg galsi noyoy, tō kēy melep galsi lēh nonoy wa tō kēy mō nēway, yatkelgi son̄wul tēl, yatkelgi son̄wul levete ba yatkelgi m̄eldēl.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivap tēngeg veg nuqul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Tigsas mavap lokse so, “Net wō niti nuqul, kē tit ququygoy vēhte mi natbey si so nim̄ōk latawle qe. !Tateh! Kē tōm̄ōk nuqul nan letno qul tō nuqul nan tihin̄yeg lō vēh. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Tō qelese anen, nēdēmdēm mey nōlōn̄veg en, kē nōlōn̄veg ēwē tō so tavasemlō me atgiy. Namanig ne haphap mey a nabat en, kē takalō me lemtam̄e. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Nēdēln̄ami wo aē, ba atmi yon̄teg galgalsi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Tō Tigsas mavap lokse van hiy kēy so, “Nohohole a kimi yon̄yon̄teg tō gōh en, kimi so dēmdēm m̄ōleg van aē. Nahap te nēk mal togyak vatag en, ba Ḡod totog ketket malig se hag van hiy nēk. So kimi wo mēdēmdēm galsi van aē en, Ḡod telep van hiy kimi nololmeyen mey a neketket malig se hag. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Net mey a kē mal lep vatag nēdēmdēm ne hohole mino en, kē tēglal malig se van. Ba net mey a kē et lep hōn te nēdēmdēm ne hohole mino en, Ḡod telep yak lok den kē nusu lolmeyen mey a kē tog tēy tō en.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivap tēngeg veg nōswō wit memtow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Vētmahē a Ḡod so nimyanag goy ige sil nonon en, ikē qelegēn. Dēm tow van hiy net vitwag a nivavah nōswō wit lētqē nonon. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Mahē niqōn̄ en kē nimtiy wa tō mahē nimyen en kē nimatyak. Kē nivanvan kēlkēl ba nōswō wit motow tō en. Tō kē et ēglal te a so nahap mak tō kē memtow wa milwo. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ba nēvētan mahgen mak tō nōswō wit memtow en, tō kē mak nayon, me atgiy kē nitaw natawhēn bah en, tō kē niō nēwan. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Tō mahē a nēwan nimta, net nan nivan tō nihe wa nitotqe m̄ōl me lepnō.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivap tēngeg veg nōswō bak a nitiy su yeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Tigsas mavap navap tēngeg vitwag se so, “?Wō lahan mahē a Ḡod so nimyanag goy ige sil nonon aē ōk, tō gēn tavap m̄ōleg vēh namtehal nan qeleave? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31-32" />Ikē qeleso nōswō bak a nitiy su yeh den vel sōwō tētēnge del lemyam kē. Mahē a kē misisgoy, tō memtow, wa tō milwo veteg nēqētēnge del, nēwtēwtēn nilililwo yeh, tō ige men tagaleg vēh ninignig nonoy van lēwtēwtēn a mahē melmel.”<verse eid="MRK 4:31-32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivap tēngeg so nivatne nisil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Tigsas mavatvatne ige sil lavap tēngeg a nam̄adeg haytēyēh van a kēy toyon̄teg m̄ōleg vēh. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Vel hohole nonon, kē et hole m̄ōleg te van hiy kēy, ba kē mohohole van hiy kēy lavap tēngeg vēlēs. Ba me atgiy, mahē ige nonon mahgey tiwag mi kē, tō kē mavasemlō nēdēmdēm del ne vap tēngeg m̄adeg nen van hiy kēy.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nigatgoy nelen̄ liwo a Lēbē Kalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Lōqōn̄ nen, lemyēpyep nan, Tigsas mavap van hiy ige nonon so, “Gēn van n̄a tekel bē liwo.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bastō kēy melep nōbō-ōt a Tigsas hagtō aē en, tō kēy hatig tō van veteg ige sil nen. Ba yatkel et madam tatag kēy lōbō-ōt tegtegha nonoy. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Kēy hōhō yow nen wah, nelen̄ liwo nihatig, miyip maymay me nen, tō mak nēbē liwo nen melkos a melkos. Tō nēbē niqtēg hayhayveg hay lelo bō-ōt nen, yipteg so nōbō-ōt niyoy. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Ba Tigsas entō lekye bō-ōt en nemtiy. Kē mēqēthēlēn̄ mi nēqēthēlēn̄. Tō ige nonon ōlōl matyak kē, tō kēy vap van hiy kē so, “!Vatgo, et van nen! !Sisqet gēn mat, ba nēk et su dēmdēm hōn te aē!”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Tō Tigsas nihatig hag tō nigatgoy nelen̄ wo, “!Tog yoyon̄!” Wa tō kē magatgoy se nēbē wo, “!Hal yoyon̄!” Tō nelen̄ nitay, wa vel haphap del nitog yoyon̄ qēt, tō mahē nivan hōw tō nitay lawlaw. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige tin̄qoy nonon so, “?Bahap tō kimi mētēgteg? ?Kimi et dēmtig qete?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ba ikēy del memtēgteg qēt, tō kēy vēy hohole lok hiy kēy mahgey wo, “!Yēhē! ?Wō nahan et gōh? Nelen̄ wa nēbē, kōyō del moyon̄teg kē.”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Team checked to here with Steve Wes and Norris. 11 October 2024</para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivōylō nuvu het den net vitwag n̄a lepnō non ige mey et Juw te</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Vētmahē a kēy mēdēn̄ me tekel bē liwo nen, tō kēy vēykal hay aslil a lepnō non ige Tekerasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Tō Tigsas mēhēw den nōbō-ōt wa tō so nivēykal aslil. Ba et misin hōn te wah, net vitwag nikalō me den negeay tamat, tō nivan me hiy Tigsas. Net nan, nuvu het mēhēw kē. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Natno togtog nonon vel geay tamat, ba tateh et so nilēg maymay lokse kē mi nējēn. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Veg kēy mal lēg vatag kē vag m̄adeg mi nējēn, leyn̄on wa lemnen, ba kē mewlēs m̄ētm̄ēt qēt. Kē namaymay wowoh, tō tateh et so nitēy maymay kē. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Vel anqōn̄ wa vel meyen kē nivanvan soloteg natno geay tamat wa n̄a wotō alge, tō kē niōlōl tawtaw ba nihelhel nataqn̄ēn mi nevet a nehey.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ba kē met Tigsas a yeh lapgetō en, tō kē niskiyak me hiy Tigsas tō nitaqlun̄ goy kē, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7-8" />tō kē nigayka ba mavap wo, “!Tigsas! !Inēk Ēntēn Ḡod a Neketket a Neketket! ?Wō nēk van me so ak nahap hiy no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:7-8">Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “!Vu het, nēk kalō den net agōh!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:7-8">Veg bohohole gōh, tō net nan mavap so, “Lahan Ḡod, nok hole maymay van hiy nēk so nitog akak memeh no!”<verse eid="MRK 5:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Tō Tigsas mēvēhge kē wo, “?Nahe ihē?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Ba kē mavap so, “Nahek ‘Nēvēwti Liwo,’ veg kemem nam̄adeg a nam̄adeg.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Tō natmat meten̄ten̄ van hiy Tigsas so kē nitog vōyvōy yak kēy den mahē anen. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Vētmahē nen, woqse qo gengen tō sili wutwut en. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Tō ige vu het mēvēhge maymay van hiy Tigsas so, “Nēk vētleg kemem n̄a lēvēwti qo, ba nēk ukēg kemem so hayveg hay hiy kēy.”<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Tō mak qeleanen, kē mukēg kēy, tō kēy van. Nuvu het del nen makalō den net nan, ba mahayveg qēt hay lelo qo. Noqo del nen, nognog van tēy vagyō (2,000), kēy meplag n̄a lebenben vitwag, tō kēy misisisgoy qēt n̄a lelo bē liwo, tō yoy qēt.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Mahē a ige betetgoy qo met van qelenen en, kēy migitgityak tō vasemlō noyoy ne age gōh lelo vōnō nonoy, wa lepnō tegtegha se a sisqet napnō nonoy. Tō ige sil van me, so et temuy nahap a Tigsas mak tō en. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Kēy van me hiy Tigsas, tō met net a nēvēwti vu het mēhēw tō kē en, hag tō nen kē mal malmal goy kē, wa nēdēmdēm nonon mal m̄ōleg lok me. Ba kēy del memtēgteg qēt. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Tō ige a met tō mi namtay, kēy kaka temun ige a mavan me en, tō kēy mavasemlō vel haphap a Tigsas mak tō van hiy net en wa veg noqo del. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Tō ige del mahē nen, mēvēhge maymay van hiy Tigsas so kē nikalō den napnō nonoy.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Mahē a Tigsas nitēytēymat so nivan lok lōbō-ōt, wah net a nuvu het mēhēw tō kē en, nemyōs so nidam Tigsas, tō kē nivēhge maymay van hiy kē wo, “Nok dam nēk.”<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ba Tigsas et buste so kē nidam kē, tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “Nēk m̄ōl lok hiy ige nōnōm, ba vasemlō van hiy kēy nahaphap del a Welan mak tō van hiy nēk, wa kē memgaysēn nēk.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Tō net nan nukēg kē, tō nivan vel mahē a lelqelqevōnō son̄wul a kēy ōl so Dekapolis, tō kē nivasemlō nahap a Tigsas mak tō van hiy kē en, tō ige del moyon̄teg tō kēy mamamakē aē.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Team checked to here with Steve Wes and Norris. 11 October 2024</para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mak wē nalqōvēn gom vitwag, wa mak ēh lok nam̄alm̄al su vitwag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Tigsas melep nōbō-ōt, tō mōm̄ōl lok me tekel bē liwo. Tō mahē kē mēvēykal aslil, woqse sil mavan me mahay walēg goy kē. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ba net liwo vitwag, kē nilwo goy nēm̄ tatay non ige Tisrael, nahan Jayrus. Mahē kē met Tigsas, kē mavan me mataqlun̄ goy nangon. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Tō kē mēvēhge maymay kē van wo, “Nam̄alm̄al su mino mogom liwo, yipteg kē nimat. Nēk van ēgē me ba tan̄ namnē apwon tō kē niwē lokse.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Tō Tigsas nitatag kē, tō kōyō van. Ba nisil liwo matatag se kē, ba kēy navan walēg biyimyin̄ kē. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ba nalqōvēn vitwag mavan me a nogom non naqal kē, ba nogom nan maqal kē bēte son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō, ba et bah hōn te. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Tō vaga kē et malaklak te, kē niyon̄teg nehet velqōn̄. Kē mal wēl vatag ige tokta a nam̄adeg, ba kē et wē hōn te, nēsēm nonon meqlen̄ yeghuquy ēwē, ba nogom nonon milwo malig se van. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27-28" />Ba kē moyon̄teg noyoy veg Tigsas, tō kē mavan tiwag me mi ige sil a lēklan Tigsas. Kē nidēmdēm mahgen so, “Wun nok tan̄qal ēwē namalmal nonon en, tō nogom mino nibah.” Tō kē niol namnen van tō nitan̄qal namalmal non Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 5:27-28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Kē matan̄qal bah namalmal nonon Tigsas en, tō vag tiwag ēwē kē moyon̄teg van lataqn̄ēn so nogom nonon mabah, tō kē mēwē.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Mahē a kē matan̄qal bah namalmal nonon, Tigsas moyon̄teg vēglal nowmat so naman nonon mavanyak den kē. Tō kē niatkēlē lok me hiy ige sil, tō nivēhge wo, “?Ihē matan̄qal namalmal mino?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ba ige nonon mavap van hiy kē so, “!Tigsas! Nisil liwo gōh, gēn navan winiwnig, tō yatkel et vanvan qalgoy mi nēk. ?Bahap tō nēk vēhge so ihē matan̄qal nēk?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ba Tigsas metet walēg kēy so kē nietsas net a matan̄qal tō kē en. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ba nalqōvēn nan mal yon̄teg vēglal van lataqn̄ēn so kē mal wē. Tō kē nivan me hiy Tigsas, a mi namtēgteg, wa mi nihiyey, tō nitaqlun̄ hōw lengon, tō nivasemlō tenenen van nahap a kē mak tō en, wa tō nikaka veg nogom nonon. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “Intik, nēdēmtig nōnōm mak tō nēk mēwē lokse. Van mi natm̄at. Nogom nōnōm mal bah ēgēn.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Mahē a Tigsas hohole lapgetō en, yatkel et mavan me den nēm̄ non Jayrus tō mavap van hiy Jayrus so, “Nam̄alm̄al su nōnōm mal mat. Itōk so nēk vap van hiy vatgo en, so kē nitog vanvan me.”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ba Tigsas moyon̄teg a kēy hohole qelenen en, tō kē nivap van hiy Jayrus so, “Nēk nitog mētēgteg, ba dēmtig ēwē.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Tō Tigsas magatgoy ige del so kēy nitog damdam tatag kē, ba kē melep ēwē Pita, Jemes, wa Jon a ēthēn Jemes, kēytēl madam kē tiwag mi Jayrus. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Kēy van dēn̄ me nēm̄ non Jayrus nen, Tigsas et van a nisil liwo taqtō anen, ba woqse valiqō a kēy yayahōlōl beten̄ten̄. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Tō kē nihayveg hay lēm̄, tō nivap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi nitog ten̄ten̄. Nam̄alm̄al gōh et mat te, kē memtiy ēwē.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ba yatkel et boyboy hiy kē aē. Tō Tigsas mōvōylō kēy, tō melep imam wa tita nonon nam̄alm̄al en, tiwag mi itēlge nonon, tō kēy hayveg hay mahē a nam̄alm̄al entō aē en. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Tō Tigsas nitēy namnen m̄alm̄al en, ba mavap van hiy kē mi nagatgat nonoy so, “Talita kumi.” Nēdēmdēm nan so, “M̄alm̄al su, nēk hatig.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Tō nam̄alm̄al nan nihatig, tō nivanvan kēlkēl. Nēte nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō. Mahē a kēy met nage qele gōh, tō kēy mamamakē aē a nilwo.<verse eid="MRK 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi nitog vavasemlō nage gōh van hiy ige sil. Ba lep negengen van hiy kē.”<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ige Tanasaret manahiy lō Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Tigsas mukēg mahē nen, tō nivan lokse litiy vōnō nonon n̄a Nasaret, ba ige nonon mavan tatag kē. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ba Lōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg, Tigsas meqtēg vatvatne n̄a lelo ēm̄ tatay. Ba mahē a ige sil moyon̄teg vel hohole del nonon en, kēy mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn, tō kēy vap so, “!Ēy! ?Wō kē melep nahaphap del gōh lōme ave? ?Tō kē melep nololmeyen gōh qeleave? ?Qeleave tō kē mak naphah nen? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Gēn nēglal kē. Ikē net bowoswos ēm̄, tita nonon Mere. Ēthēn wa Jemes, Jōsēp, Judas ba Simon. Ba ige yatētētan tog tiwag tō mi gēn agōh.” Ba kēy et malaklak te veg kē, kēy et buste kē.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Ba net lēgēlgēg non Ḡod en, ige sil telepnō tegha tēdēmap kē. Ba ige telepnō nonon tiwag mi tiy ige nonon, kēy tit dēmap vēhte kē.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Tō Tigsas et ak hōn te naphah lepnō anen, ba kē matan̄ ēwē namnen apwon yatkel gom, tō kēy mēwē lokse. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ba Tigsas mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn veg ige sil telepnō nonon et dēmtig te kē.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Tigsas mēvētleg lō ige hal nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō, so kēy toytoy</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Tō Tigsas mavan kēlkēl, kē mavan heylō me lepnō geh me nen, tō nivatvatne ige sil. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Bahnentō Tigsas mōlōl tiwag me ige hal nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō, tō kē mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi wo mavan vel vōnō ba kimi vanvan vōvōyō lepnō vitwag.” Tō kē melep van naman hiy kēy so kēy vōy yak nuvu het den ige et. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Tō Tigsas mavap lokse van hiy kēy so, “Kimi wo mavan ba nitog tēytēy te hap bavanvan tēy lemtehal, qeleso, negengen, si natan̄ haphap, si nēsēm, ba kimi tēy ēwē nēqētōwtōw. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Ba atmi hey nasandol, ba nitog leplep se neleleh nonmi; atmi vantēy vēlēs mey a kimi hey tō anen. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Mahē a kimi wo mavan me lepnō vitwag en, ihēte den kēy wo melep vasgēt kimi, atmi tog vēlēs a lēm̄ nonon, gaydēn̄ a kimi van den napnō anen. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Sowo yatkel vōnō et lep vasgēt te kimi lēm̄ nonoy, kēy et yon̄teg te kimi, atmi vanyak den napnō nonoy. Ba atmi ohyeg veteg nēvētan den nayn̄omi veg ige telepnō anen. Igōhkē nēvēglal hiy kēy veg kēy mak nage mey a et tenenen te.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Tō kēy van tō toytoy van hiy ige sil so kēy wulyis nēdēmdēm nonoy den negengenyeg. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bahnentō kēy vōy lōlō woqse vu het den ige et, tō kēy lōwyeg nisim van hiy woqse et gom, tō kēy mēwē lok.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namatmat nonon Jon Vasugyon̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ba Nēqēt Mayanag Herod moyon̄teg noyoy veg Tigsas, veg ige sil del hohole gatay kē a vel vōnō del en. Yatkel et vap so, “Wun Jon Vasugyon̄ mēh lokse den namatmat, tō naman nonon aē bakak vahah en.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ba yatkel et vap so, “Wun ikē Elijah.” Bahnentō yatkelgi den kēy vap so, “Wun ikē net lēgēlgēg vitwag qele ige et lēgēlgēg tam̄ag.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Mahē a Herod moyon̄teg noyoy geh gōh en, tō kē mavap so, “Igōhkē Jon Vasugyon̄ a no mehelm̄ēt tō nēnlon, ikē mēh lok me anen.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-20" />Veg am̄ag Herod muwuhmat Jon so ak malaklak Herodias. Nakaka qelegēn. Am̄ag nalqōvēn Herodias en, ikē ēgnōn Filip a ēthēn Herod. Ba Herod mewseg Herodias den ēthēn tō nileg mi kē. Bastō Jon mohole tō van hiy Herod so, “Nele magatgoy so nēk tit leg vēhte mi ēgnōn ithi.” Ba veg bohohole gōh, Herodias mamatwolwol tō mi Jon, tō kē nemyōs so niwuh mat kē. Ba Herod et ukēg te kē veg Herod nemtēgteg. Herod nemtēgteg Jon veg kē nēglal so Jon net tenenen a noyon̄ hiy Ḡod, wa kē netgoy kē. Ba Herod mōm̄ōk Jon lēm̄ yētyēt ēwē. Mahē a kē moyon̄teg nohohole nonon Jon en, nohohole nan mowontig mi kē, ba kē nemlaklak vaga so niyon̄teg.<verse eid="MRK 6:17-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Lōqōn̄ vitwag, Herod mak negengen liwo bōqōn̄ wotwot nonon. Tō kē mēvētleg goy ige lililwo del a leln̄e mayanag nonon tiwag mi ige m̄agoy ige bepgapgal nonon, wa ige lililwo del Takalili so kēy van me bōqōn̄ wotwot nonon. Igōhkē namtehal a Herodias metsas so Jon tamat vēh aē. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mahē Herod nimlaklak tiwag mi ige sil nen wah, nam̄alm̄al nonon Herodias nihayveg hay me tō nilaklak van lengoy. Tō kēy del memlaklak aē a nēkēkēn. Tō Herod mavap van hiy nam̄alm̄al en so, “Nahap te a nēk vēhge en, no telep van hiy nēk.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Tō kē mavatvat maymay van hiy nam̄alm̄al en so, “Nahap te a nēk mōyōs den no en, no telep van hiy nēk, sowo yatkel yōnyōntey mino, no telep van hiy nēk.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kē moyon̄teg bah qelenen, tō kē nikalō ēgē tō nivap van hiy tita nonon wo, “?Wō no tēvēhge vēh nahap?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Tita nonon meplu goy so, “Nēqtēn Jon Vasugyon̄.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Bastō kē niplag lok me hiy mayanag, tō kē mavap van hiy kē so, “No nemyōs so nēk lep nēqtēn Jon Vasugyon̄, nēk m̄ōk veteg hōw letbey su, ba lep me hiy no a yipteg agōh.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mahē a mayanag moyon̄teg bah nohohole gōh en, kē mololwon a nēkēkēn. Ba veg kē mal vatvat maymay vatag a lengon ige del, tō kē tit leh vēhte nohohole nonon. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Tō vag tiwag ēwē kē nivētleg net vagapgal vitwag so nivan tēy me nēqtēn Jon. Tō net nan mavan me lēm̄ yētyēt nen tō nihelm̄ēt nēqtēn Jon, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />ba mōm̄ōk hōw letbey su, ba melep me tō mohog van hiy nam̄alm̄al en. Tō nam̄alm̄al nan nihog van hiy tita nonon ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Mahē a ige nonon Jon moyon̄teg noyoy veg kē, tō kēy van me tō lep nataqn̄ēn, tō tivig lelo qayan̄ a leqyo vet.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mepn̄en ige sil tey vag tēvēlēm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Tigsas mēvētleg tō ige hal bemgumgu vel vōnō, tō me atgiy en, kēy mōm̄ōl lok me hiy kē ba mavasemlō nahaphap del a kēy mak wa mavatne tō ige sil aē. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige nonon so, “Atmi van me. Gēn van mahē a net tateh aē, tō gēn m̄ōkheg tusu.” Veg woqse et vanvan me hiy Tigsas, yatkelgi vanvan me, yatkelgi m̄ōlm̄ōl lok, ak tō so Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon tateh mahē geh a so kēy m̄ōkheg begengen.<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Tō Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon melep nōbō-ōt nen, tō kēy van me mahē vitwag a tateh et aē. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ba mahē a Tigsas kēy mavan en, woqse et netgeh a kēy mēqyeg, tō met vēglal kēy. Tō ige sil gōh mahatig den napnō nonoy del, tō kēy meskiyak lō aslil tō mēdēn̄ me am̄ag mahē a Tigsas so nivan me aē en. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Vētmahē a Tigsas mevey kal hay aslil en, kē met a nisil liwo taqtō anen. Tō kē memgaysēn kēy, veg ikēy qeleso ige sipsip a tateh et so nietgoy kēy. Tō kē mavatne kēy mi woqse haphap.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Yipteg mahē nimyēpyep, tō ige non Tigsas mavan me hiy kē, tō kēy vap so, “Vētmahē gōh tateh gengen geh, ba yipteg nalo niyoy. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Itōk so nēk vētleg m̄ōlm̄ōl ige gōh tō kēy van lēm̄ wa lepnō a sisqet geh me agōh, tō kēy wēl negengen.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ba Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi lep van negengen hiy kēy.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Tō ige nonon mavap van hiy kē so, “?Qeleave? ?Nēk nemyōs so kemem wēl negengen mi nēsēm tey vagyō so ven̄en kēy aē?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “?Wō nēbrēyt vēvēh aē nen? Atmi van ba et.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Kēy metsas bah en, tō kēy mavap van hiy kē so, “Tēvēlēm wōy, tiwag mi nōmōmō wōy vōyō.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige sil so kēy haghiy how liviwti vivitwag loyoplih m̄am̄al anen. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Tō ige sil mahaghiy hōw lēvēwti a nam̄adeg, yatkel viwti net m̄eldēl vag tiwag, ba yatkel viwti, ikēy son̄wul tēvēlēm. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Bahnentō Tigsas melep nēbrēyt tēvēlēm, tiwag mi nōmōmō vōyō nen, tō kē matkal hag alge ba mēvēwē Ḡod aē. Tō kē mōtōq woywoy nēbrēyt nan, ba melep van hiy ige tin̄qoy, tō kēy asēg van hiy ige sil. Bastō kē mōtōq lalat nōmōmō vōyō se qelenen, tō masēg se van hiy kēy. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Tō ige del megen a natqay misis qēt. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Tō kēy mehn̄ēn yakyak nagayte gengen a kēy megengen lēlēge tō en, natbey son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō a noy geh. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Nisil a megen negengen gōh, ikēy tey vag tēvēlēm, ba meptah vēlēs ige tam̄an.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavanvan apwo bē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige tin̄qoy nonon so kēy yem ēgē lōbō-ōt, ba hō am̄ag tekel bē liwo, tō kēy van n̄a lelqelqevōnō vitwag, nahan Bētsayta. Ba Tigsas mahag qōtō so nivētleg m̄ōlm̄ōl ige sil lepnō nonoy. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Tō mahē a Tigsas mavap anqōn̄ nēwē bah hiy kēy en, tō kē nivēykal hag luwutwut tō kē nitatay.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Vētmahē a niqtēg mēlēglēg en, nōbō-ōt mal dēn̄ me lēvētne bē liwo, ba Tigsas mahgen lapgetō aslil. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ba Tigsas netgeh a kēy hōhō tō lōbō-ōt en. Ba kēy yon̄teg nememeh bōhōhō, veg kēy hōhō goy namte len̄. Ba mahē ninognog meyen me wah, Tigsas nivan me hiy kēy, a kē nivanvan apwo bē. Tō Tigsas nivan basay kēy so nivan tasga. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ba mahē a kēy met kē a nivanvan me apwo bē en, ba kēy dēmdēm so natmat. Tō kēy gaygayka ēgēn, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />veg kēy del met kē, tō kēy memtēgteg a nēkēkēn. Ba Tigsas mavap ēgē van hiy kēy so, “Tig maymay. !Ino agōh! Kimi nitog mētēgteg.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Tō Tigsas niyem kal hag hiy kēy nen, wah, nelen̄ nitay. Tō kēy mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />veg kēy et ēglal m̄ōleg te nitiy dēmdēm ne vahah a Tigsas mak tō en, a bēbrēyt tēvēlēm. Veg nēqtēy namaymay wowoh.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mak wē ige gom n̄a Kēnēsaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy mavan lege lēbē liwo nen, mēdēn̄ napnō vitwag, nahan Kēnēsaret, tō kēy mēlēg maymay nōbō-ōt van anen. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ba mahē a kēy mēvēykal hay aslil, ige telepnō nen met vēglal Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Tō kēy siksikyak vel vōnō, tō vēl me ige gom. Kēy mahah me ige gom a leqe nonoy, tō vantēy kēy me hiy Tigsas avetē kē aē. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Vel mahē a kē nivan aē en, kēy vantēy me ige gom hiy kē. Ige telepnō susu wa lelqelqevōnō, wa vel vōnō tegtegha geh me anen, ba kēy leveteg ige gom del a tenepnō. Tō kēy vēhge Tigsas so kē niukēg ige gom so tan̄qal ēwē nagloglo malmal nonon. Tō ige del a kēy mak qelenen en, kēy mēwē lokse.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Ige lililwo goy ige Tisrael mololgagay Tigsas, veg kē et tatag te nēvēnay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Yatkel Farisi tiwag mi yatkel vatvatgo Bele a kēy mavan tō me den Jerusalem, kēy mavan me mahay walēg goy Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Tō kēy met yatkel tin̄qoy non Tigsas a kēy gengen tō en, ba namney nelem, veg kēy et sōwōswōl te. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Nēvēnan ige Juw, so kēy wo et sōwōswōl te namney en, tō kēy tit gengen vēhte. Tō ige Farisi namaymay goy nēvēnay. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ba mahē a kēy m̄ōl lok me den letno wēlwēl gengen en, so kēy wo et sōwōswōl te, tō kēy tit gengen vēhte. Navatvatne lēvēnay nam̄adeg, qeleso, naswōswōl vinlah, nuwmet si no-oh tēbē.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Tō ige Farisi gōh tiwag mi ige vatvatgo Bele, kēy mēvēhge van hiy Tigsas wo, “?Bahap tō ige nōnōm et tatag te nēvēnangēn, a ige yatqōtqōn gēn mavatne tō gēn aē? ?Bahap tō kēy gengen, ba kēy et sōwōswōl te namney?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Tō Tigsas meplu goy ige Farisi so, “Me am̄ag, Isaya melgēlgēg tenenen tō veg kimi a nangomi vōyō. Kē mayap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">Ige gōh, kēy dēmap no mi nan̄yay ēwē,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">ba nalo taqay yeh tewiwi den no.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kēy mogmogo goy no, yeghuquy ēwē,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">kēy vap so kēy vatvatne ige sil mi nēdēmdēm non Ḡod, ba wele wo nēdēmdēm non net ēwē.<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Kimi mukēg veteg Nele non Ḡod, bastō kimi mētēy maymay ēwē nēvēnan ige et.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Tigsas wo, “Kimi melepyak Nele non Ḡod tō so lep kal nēvēnami. !Namtevumi itōk!” Kē hohole tō nōk ba nēdēmdēm nonon mahē tegha. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Tō kē nivap so, “Me am̄ag, Mosis mavap so, ‘Kimi so dēmap imam wa tita nonmi.’ Tō kē mavap se so, ‘Net a nihole hethet hiy imam wa tita nonon en, atmi wuh mat kē.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ba kimi vatvatne ige sil so net tit biyin̄ vēhte imam wa tita nonon. Ba kē nivap van hiy kōyō so, ‘Natkel hap aē mino a nok so lep van hiy kōmyō, so biyin̄ kōmyō aē, ba no tit lep vēhte van hiy kōmyō veg no mal vatvat vatag aē so lep van hiy Ḡod.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Tō nohohole gōh nigatgoy kē, tō kē tit biyin̄ vēhte imam wa tita nonon. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ba lēdēmdēm gōh en, kimi mak nohohole non Ḡod qeleso nage yeghuquy ēwē, veg a bavatvatne tēlēvēnanmi a kimi vatvatne kēy aē en. Woqse dēmdēm mey nehet aē mi kimi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nahaphap a kē niak so net nilem lengon Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Tō Tigsas niōlōl me ige sil so kēy van me hiy kē, tō kē nivap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi del yon̄teg galsi me nohohole mino tō kimi so yon̄teg vēglal. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Nahap taslil tit hayveg vēhte hay hiy net so nak lemlem kē. Ba nahaphap a nikalō me den net en, meynen a niak lemlem kē lengon Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Nēdēln̄ami wo aē, ba atmi yon̄teg galgalsi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Me atgiy, Tigsas mavan den ige sil tō nikalbat hay lēm̄. Tō ige tin̄qoy nonon mēvēhge kē bēdēmdēm ne vaptēngeg nan. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “?Qeleave? ?Kimi et ēglal qete de? Kimi so ēglal so vel haphap a net nigengen en tit ak lemlem vēhte kē lengon Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Nahaphap geh nen tit hayveg vēhte van lēdēmdēm nonon net. Kē nihayveg ēwē hay letqan, tō nikalō lokse den nataqn̄ēn.” Lohohole gōh, Tigsas mavap so vel gengen del vēlēs newenwen geh lengon Ḡod.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Tō Tigsas wo, “Ba nahap a nikalō me den nēdēmdēm non net tiple ak lemlem kē lengon Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Veg nēdēmdēm het bubug nikalō me den lēdēmdēm non net. Nēdēmdēm belegleg solosloteg, batan̄tan̄hephep, buwuhmat et, beleplep ēgnōn net tegha, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />beqneqneg, bemyōs het, bem̄eygal, botogay het, bamatwolwol, bagalgalyak hohole, bohohole sotel, wa bēqētqēt maymay. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Vel dēmdēm del mey a nehet gōh takalō me den nēdēmdēm nonon net tō kē niak net nilem lengon Ḡod.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mōvōylō nuvu het den nam̄alm̄al nonon nalqōvēn Tikrik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Tigsas mavan den Kalili, tō mavan me legeay vōnō Taya. Tō kē mavan tō mahayveg n̄a lēm̄ vitwag, ba kē et buste so ige sil so ēglal kē. Ba kē tit taqbat vēhte den kēy veg kēy mal ēglal kē. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Lepnō nen, nalqōvēn vitwag, nam̄alm̄al nonon, nuvu het mēhēw kē. Ba nalqōvēn nan moyon̄teg noyoy so Tigsas mal dēn̄ me, tō kē nivan me tō nitaqlun̄ goy hōw lengon Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ba nalqōvēn gōh, ikē et Juw te, kē nage telepnō Fonisia n̄a Siria. Tō kē mēvēhge maymay van hiy Tigsas so kē nivōylō natmat den ēntēn.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy nalqōvēn nen so, “Itōk so ven̄en toqsis bah ige nētnētm̄ey en. Ba et wē te so lep nagay te gengen nagan ige nētnētm̄ey ba suwyeg van hiy ige tok.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ba nalqōvēn meplu goy Tigsas so, “Welan, hēywē, ba ige tok a laln̄e tono gengen en, kēy gengen goy nigin gengen nagan ige nētnētm̄ey a nisisisgoy.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “Veg nēk meplu goy no qelenen, itōk, no mal galeg. Nēk hatig ba m̄ōl. Nuvu het mal kalō qēt den nam̄alm̄al nōnōm.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Nalqōvēn mōm̄ōl lok me en, tō kē et van qelekē nam̄alm̄al nonon en yoyon̄ tō a letno tamge nonon, a nuvu het mal kalō qēt den kē.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mak wē net vitwag a kē noqoywon ba nōlōt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Tigsas mahatig den napnō liwo Taya, tō kē nivan heylō lepnō Saydon, van dēn̄ mahē kēy ōl so Dekapolis, sisqet Lēbē Liwo a Kalili. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Mahē a kē mēdēn̄ lepnō nen, tō yatkel et mavantēy me net vitwag hiy kē a noqoywon, ba nōlōt. Tō kēy vēhge Tigsas so nitan̄ namnen apwon tō kē niwē lokse.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Tō Tigsas melep net nan, kōyō mavan yak den ige sil. Tō Tigsas nim̄ōk nēqētbōhōn n̄a lēdēln̄an. Tō kē minih van lēqētqētbōhōn tekelgi tō nim̄ōk n̄a lagayman net nan. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Tō Tigsas matkal hag alge tō kē mōm̄ōkheg apap ba mavap so, “Ephata.” Nēdēmdēm nan so, “Nēk wak.” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Tō vagtiwag ēwē, nēdēln̄an nim̄lō tō kē niyon̄teg galsi, wa nagayman mēwē tō kē nihole galsi.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Tō Tigsas mōlgontegoy kēy so kēy tog vavasemlō van hiy ige sil. Ba mahē kē mōlgontegoy bah kēy en, vaga kēy et yon̄teg te ba gaygayka malig se hag. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ige sil mamamakē aē yeh veg Tigsas, tō kēy mavap so, “Yēhē, vel haphap a kē niakak en, itōktōk vēlēs. Net a moqoywon tō am̄ag, ba togtōkē kē moyon̄yon̄teg lok, net mey a nōlōt ba kē mohohole lok.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas mepn̄en nisil tey vag vet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Lōqōn̄ tegha se, nisil liwo mahaytiwag me hiy Tigsas, ba negengen nagay mabah. Bahnentō Tigsas mōlōltiwag me ige tin̄qoy nonon, tō mavap van hiy kēy so, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“No nemgaysēn ige sil agōh, veg kēy mal tog vatag mi no nōqōn̄ vētēl, tō negengen nagay mal qēt. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />So no wo mēvētleg m̄ōlm̄ōl kēy a et gengen te en, nataqn̄ēy tem̄geygey bamaygay a metehal, Wa yatkelgi den kēy, napnō nonoy yeh tewiwi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ba ige tin̄qoy nonon mavap van hiy Tigsas so, “?Wō gēn telep me negengen nagay lōme ave? Mahē gōh yeh den napnō.”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Tō Tigsas mēvēhge lokse kēy wo, “?Ba nēbrēyt vēvēh mi kimi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Kēy vap so, “Liviyō.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige sil so kēy hag hiy hōw lēvētan. Bastō kē melep nēbrēyt liviyō nen, ba mēvēwē Ḡod aē. Tō kē mōtōq woywoy bah en, tō nilep van hiy ige nonon so kēy asēg van hiy ige sil. Tō kēy mak qeleanen. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ba yatkel mōmō susu se aē. Tō Tigsas matatay goy bah nōmōmō geh nen en, tō kē nilep van hiy ige nonon so kēy aseg se van hiy ige sil en. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ige sil del megen toqsis qēt, tō lēkle gengen, ige nonon mehn̄ēn yakyak nagayte gengen a kēy megengen lēlēge tō en, natbey liviyō. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ige sil a megen negengen nan en, ikēy tege tey vag vet, ba meptah ēwē ige tam̄an. Tō me atgiy, Tigsas nivētleg m̄ōlm̄ōl kēy lepnō nonoy. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Wa Tigsas tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy nonon van tō yem kal ēgē lōbō-ōt, tō kēy van dēn̄ mahē vitwag nahan Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yatkel Farisi mēvēhge Tigsas so kē niak naphah bavasemlō so Ḡod mēvētleg kē me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Tō yatkel Farisi mavan me tō meqtēg vēyvavaleh mi Tigsas. Kēy soksok nēvēglal den lōtōk en so helet etgal kē. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Ba Tigsas moyon̄teg nehet yeh lēdēmdēm nonon, tō kē mōm̄ōkheg apap aē ba mavap so, “?Bahap tō kimi qiyig gōh nemyōs so et nēvēglal? Hēyhēywē, nok vap van hiy kimi so kimi tit et vēhte nēvēglal qeleanen.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Tō Tigsas nivan veteg ige Farisi, tō niyem lokse lōbō-ōt nen, tō nivan tekel bē liwo.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mohole van hiy ige nonon veg nēqtēy namaymay wowoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ba ige non Tigsas mololqōn̄ so lep te gengen se, veg kēy melep nēbrēyt vitwag woy ēwē lōbō-ōt. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Tō Tigsas mohole vētday van hiy kēy so, “Kimi etgoy galsi kimi den nis nonon ige Farisi wa nis non Herod.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Tō kēy vēy hohole lok hiy kēy mahgey so, “Kē mohole qelenen veg gēn et lep teme nēbrēyt.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ba Tigsas nēglal nēdēmdēm nonoy, tō kē mavap so, “?Bahap tō kimi vēy hohole hiy kimi so nēbrēyt tateh? ?Qeleave, kimi et et vēglal qete? !Niqtimi namaymay a namaymay wowoh! <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Namtami aē, ba kimi et et vēglal te nahap vitwag. Nēdēln̄ami aē, ba kimi et yon̄teg vēglal te nahap vitwag. ?Wō kimi mal lolqōn̄ nahap a gēn mak tō ōk? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />?Mahē a no melep nēbrēyt tēvēlēm, no mōtōq woywoy tō melep van hiy ige tey vag tēvēlēm, me atgiy, kimi mehn̄ēn yak nagayte gengen nen natbey vēvēh?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Tō kēy vap so, “Natbey son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Tō Tigsas mavap lokse so, “?Vētmahē a no melep nēbrēyt liviyō tō mepn̄en ige sil tey vag vet, me atgiy kimi mehn̄ēn yak nagayte gengen natbey vēvēh?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Kēy mavap so, “Liviyō.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige nonon so, “?Ba qeleave, kimi et et vēglal qete no?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mak wē namatbē vitwag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Tō Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon mavan heylō me lelqelqevōnō n̄a Bētsayta. Tō yatkel et mavantēy me namatbē vitwag hiy Tigsas, tō kēy mēvēhge maymay Tigsas so kē nitan̄ namnen apwon so niak wē kē. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Tō Tigsas mētēy namnen namatbe nan, tō nivantēy yak kē den nalo vōnō. Tō kē minih van lemtan namatbē nan, ba mōm̄ōk namnen apwon, tō nivēhge kē so, “?Wō nēk net vēglal yatkel haphap?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Tō net nan met kal hag, ba metet kēlkēl tō kē mavap so, “O-oh, no met ige et kēy vanvan kēlkēl, ba ikēy qeleso nēqētēnge ēwē.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Tō Tigsas nitan̄ lokse namnen n̄a lemtan namatbē en, tō kē metet, wah, namtan niwē galgalsi. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Tō Tigsas mohole maymay van hiy kē so, “Nēk nitog vanvan lokse van lelo vōnō anen, ba nēk m̄ōl togolgol n̄a lepnō nōnōm.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita nivasemlō so Tigsas, ikē Kraēs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Tō Tigsas tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy nonon mavan me den Bētsayta a Kalili, tō kēy mavan vel vōnō susu sisqet Sisaria Filipae. Mahē a kēy vanvan me metehal nen, ba kē mēvēhge van hiy ige tin̄qoy wo, “?Ige sil vap so ino ihē?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Tō kēy meplu goy kē so, “Yatkel et vap so inēk Jon Vasugyon̄, ba yatkel et vap so inēk Elijah, net lēgēlgēg non Ḡod. Wa yatkel et vap so inēk vitwag den ige et lēgēlgēg non Ḡod tam̄ag.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Tō Tigsas mēvēhge kēy wo, “?Ba kimi vap so ino ihē?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pita meplu goy kē so, “Inēk Kraēs.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Tō Tigsas mōlgontegoy kēy so nitog vasemlō nohohole gōh van hiy ige sil, so ikē Kraēs.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavasemlō am̄ag so kē tamat, ba me atgiy en, kē tēh lokse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Tō Tigsas meqtēg vatvatne ige nonon, ba kē mavap so, “Ninti Et toyon̄memeh liwo. Ige et lililwo, tiwag mi ige lililwo goy ige pris, wa ige vatvatgo Bele en, kēy tet buste kē. Tō kēy tuwuh mat kē, ba lēkle qōn̄ vētēl en kē tēh lokse.”<verse eid="MRK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Tigsas mavasemlō nohohole gōh van hiy ige nonon a nemtawle galsi. Ba Pita melep kē tekel metehal tō niqtēg hole maymay van hiy Tigsas so nigatgoy kē. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ba Tigsas mat kēlē me hiy ige nonon, tō kē nihole maymay van hiy Pita. Kē mavap so, “Satan, nēk vayak den no. Nēdēmdēm nōnōm et dēmdēm non Ḡod te, ba nēdēmdēm non net vēlēs.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Net non Tigsas so nitigoy vel haphap a kē mahgen nemyōs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Tigsas mōlōl me ige sil tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy nonon, so kēy van me hiy kē, tō kē nivap van hiy kēy so, “Net wo nemyōs so nidam tatag no, kē nitēygoy nēdēmdēm nonon den nahap a kē mahgen nemyōs, tō kē niywu nowolwol nonon, tō nidam tatag no. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Net mey a nemyōs so nivaēh nēh nonon lemyam gōh en, kē tak qelen̄ nēh nonon. Ba net a nēh nonon teqlen̄ veg no, wa veg boyoy ēwē mino en, kē tetsas nēh lap. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />?So net wo nilep qēt nahaphap del a kē nemyōs lemyam gōh en, ba nēh nonon niqlen̄ aē, wo itōk mi kē? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />?Wō nahap aē lemyam a so tēwēl yak nēh non net den namatmat? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Net a nataqn̄ēn nimamayge so nivasemlō nahek wa nohohole mino lengon ige gengenyeg a nitig kēlē Ḡod qiyig gōh en, Ninti Et tēlēn̄lēn̄teg se kē babah ne qōn̄, mahē kē nivan me mi nēlēn̄as non Imam, wa tiwag mi ige in̄sel yon̄.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige sil so, “Hēyhēywē, nok vap van hiy kimi so yatkel et den kimi tigtō gōh, kēy tit mat vēhte gaydēn̄ a kēy et namyeyen non Ḡod nivan me mi namaymay.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Team checked to here with Norris 25 October 2024</para>
  <para style="s">Nataqn̄ēn Tigsas mēlēn̄as</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Lēkle qōn̄ levete, Tigsas melep Pita, Jemes ba Jon, kēy mēvēykal n̄a wotō liwo vitwag, kēytēl mahgeytel madam Tigsas. Tō kēytēl etvan qelekē, nataqn̄ēn Tigsas me leh tō metegha. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Namalmal nonon maqagqag a maqagqag lēs qele natwēh tayay, tateh haphap lemyam naqagqag qeleanen, ba nēbēybēy a nēbēybēy lēs. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Tō itēlge nonon met yoge vōyō mavan me hiy kē, Elisa ba Mosis, kōyō kaka tiwag mi Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Tō Pita mavap van hiy Tigsas so, “!Vatgo! Nitiy wē yeh a kamtēl me agōh. Itōk so kamtēl tēy natvēlgapye woy vētēl, nōnōm vitwag, non Mosis vitwag, ba nonon Elisa vitwag.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Pita mavap qelegōh en veg kē et ēglal te so kē nihole qeleave, veg kēytēl memtēgteg qēt.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Tō namlēg nivan me nen, tō nitaq melmel goy kēy. Ba nohohole mavan me den namlēg en so, “Igōhkē Intik a no natam yeh kē. Atmi yon̄teg galsi kē.”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Itēlge nonon et me qelekē, Mosis ba Elisa, kōyō tateh, ba Tigsas mahgen mitig lap. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Mahē kēy hēwhēw tēqēl me den wotō nen, Tigsas nivap van hiy kēytēl so, “Kēmtēl nitog vavasemlō vel haphap a kēmtēl met tō hag wotō en gaydēn̄ a Ēntēn Net nihatig lok den namatmat.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Tō itēlge nonon gōh mak tatag nahap a Tigsas mavap tō van hiy kēytēl en. Ba kēytēl et yon̄teg vēglal te nohohole nan a Tigsas mavap a so, Ḡod tak hatig lokse kē den namatmat. Tō kēytēl vēy hohole aē so, “?Wō nēdēmdēm ne hohole nonon gōh qeleave?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mohohole van hiy itēlge yowyowveg nonon veg Elisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Itēlge nonon gōh mēvēhge Tigsas so, “Bahap tō ige vatvatgo Bele mavap so net lēgēlgēg Elisa tavan lok me am̄ag den Kraēs?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Tō Tigsas mavap so, “!Hēywē! Net lēgēlgēg Elisa tavan lok me am̄ag so niak tenenen vel haphap del. ?Bahap tō, Nabaebol mavap so Ēntēn Net tō yon̄memeh ba haphap a nam̄adeg, wa kēy tak hiy kē a nehet? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ba nok vap van hiy kimi nēhēyhēywē, Elisa nan mal van me. Ba nisil mak hiy kē a nehet, qele navavap non Ḡod mavap tō aē en.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mōvōyyak nuvu het den nēnētm̄ey tam̄an</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Mahē Tigsas tiwag mi itēlge nonon m̄olm̄ōl lokse me hiy yatkel et nonon, kēy met nisil liwo haywilig goy tō ige non Tigsas. Veg yatkel vatvatgo Bele vēyvavaleh tiwag mi kēy. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Mahē ige sil met Tigsas nivanvan me nen, tō kēy m̄alyow veg kē. Kēy gitgityak me tō tan̄ lemnen ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Ba Tigsas mēvēhge van hiy kēy so, “?Kimi vēy vavaleh tō nen bahap?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Net vitwag den kēy mavap so, “!Vatgo! No mavantēy me intik hiy nēk so ak wē kē veg nuvu het mēhēw kē, tō kē et hohole te. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Yatkel mahē a nuvu het niqal maymay kē en, kē nisisgoy n̄a lēvētan, ba nosog nikakalō me den naplan wa nigaygayyēy nēlwon. Tō nataqn̄ēn nit gotgomiy. Ba no mēvēhge ige hal nōnōm so kēy vōy yak nuvu het gōh den kē, ba kēy akak lēlēge.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi togtō qiyig kē nēdēmtig nonmi et maymay te. ?Wō no totog tiwag mi kimi gaydēn̄ an̄ēh? ?Nok so biyin̄ se kimi vag vēh? Atmi lep me nēnētm̄ey en.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Tō kēy lep kē me hiy Tigsas ēgēn. Mahē a nuvu het met Tigsas nen, kē mak nēnētm̄ey nan nataqn̄ēn me yeyey a me yeyey, tō kē nisisgoy hōw lēvētan. Tō kē nitatatwul kēlkēl wa nosog nikakalō me den naplan. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Ba Tigsas mēvēhge van hiy imam nonon so, “?Wō nēte vēvēh vatag a kē niakak qelegōh?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Imam nonon mavap so, “Nage gōh maqal tō kē a kē nusu lapgetō. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Nuvu het gōh mal akak etgal kē vagm̄adeg so niak sisgoy nēnētm̄ey nan lep wa lēbē, so niwuh mat kē. So nēk wo tak vēh nahap qiyig vitwag, ba nēk magaysēn kemem, wa biyin̄ kemem.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Tigsas mavap van hiy imam nonon so, “Ḡod tak vēh vel haphap, so nēk wo nēdēmtig.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Tō vag tiwag woy, imam non nēnētm̄ey en mohole mi neten̄ten̄ so, “Welan, no nēdēmtig. Ba nēk biyin̄ no, veg nēdēmtig mino nusu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Mahē Tigsas met nisil nivanvan me hiy kē en, kē mohole maymay van hiy nuvu het nan so, “Vu het ne qoywon wa ne lōt. !Nok vap van hiy nēk! !Nēk kalō den nēnētm̄ey agōh! Ba nēk nitog vanvan lok me hiy kē.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Tō nuvu het en mōltaw, wa mak nēnētm̄ey nan mamat higap. Wa nataqn̄ēn me yeyey a me yeyey, tō nuvu het nan nikalō den kē. Ba kēy met van en, qeleso nēnētm̄ey nan mamat, tō nisil mavap so, “Kē mal mat.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ba Tigsas mētēy namnen wa niyap hatig kē, tō nitig ketket ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Mahē Tigsas mahayveg lelo ēm̄ tiwag mi ige nonon, kēy vap van hiy kē so, “?Bahap tō kemem tit vōylō vēhte nuvu het gōh?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Tigsas mavap so, “Natatay vēlēs tōvōyyak vēh nuvu het qeleanen.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivasemlō lokse so kē tamat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy nonon mukēg mahē nen, wa mavan heylō me Kalili. Ba Tigsas et muste so nisil niēglal mahē a kē aē en, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />veg kē nemyōs so nivatvatne ige tin̄qoy nonon. Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Yatkel et ten̄yeg Ēntēn Net. Tō kēy tuwuh mat kē. Ba Ḡod qoyo ak ēh lokse kē lēkle qōn̄ vētēl.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Cleaned up 9:30-50 for Anglican lectionary with Colenso and Laisa 9 September 2024</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ba ige nonon et ēglal galsi te nēdēmdēm ne hohole non Tigsas, ba kēy memtēgteg so vēhge kē aē.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">?Ihē net liwo yeh?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon mavan me Kapaniam nen, tō kalbat hay lēm̄ vitwag. Tō Tigsas mēvēhge van hiy kēy so, “?Wō Kimi vēy vavaleh bahap a gēn vanvan me metehal en?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ba ige nonon et vulu goy te kē, veg kēy vanvan lemtehal en, kēy vēy vavaleh so ihē den kēy tilwo goy kēy.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Tigsas nihaghiy hōw en, tō niōlōl me ige tin̄qoy son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō. Tō kē mavap van hiy kēy so, “Net wo nemyōs so nilwo goy yatkel et en, kē nim̄ōk tēqēl kē mahgen n̄a antan. Tō kē nivan me net mugumgu nonoy.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Tō Tigsas melep me nēnētm̄ey vitwag, ba mēvētgiy kē a lēvētnay. Tō Tigsas moyveg goy nēnētm̄ey nan, ba mavap van hiy kēy so, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Net a nilep vasgēt nēnētm̄ey qelegōh lehek en, kē nilep vasgēt no. Ba net a nilep vasgēt no en, kē et ak te hiy no, ba hiy Imam Ḡod a kē mēvētleg tō no me.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Net a et tavale te mi gēn en, ikē bulsal nongēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Tō Jon mavap van hiy Tigsas so, “!Vatgo! Kemem met net vitwag nivōyvōylō nuvu het den yatkel et a lehe. Ba kemem magatgoy kē, veg ikē et lēvēwti nongēn te.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ba Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi nitog gatgatgoy net qelenen, veg net qelenen niak naphah lehek en, kē tit hole hethet ēgē vēhte lehek. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Net a et tavale te mi gēn en, ikē tiwag mi gēn. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nok vap hēyhēywē van hiy kimi, net a nilep van nivinlah bē hiy kimi so in en veg kimi ige non Kraēs, Ḡod telep van hiy kē nayseyse aē.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nahaphap a tak sisgoy net legengenyeg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Tigsas mavap so, “Nēnētm̄ey a nēdēmtig no, ba net vitwag niak sisgoy kē legengenyeg en, Ḡod telep van hiy kē nēvēvēg liwo aē. Nitiy wē yeh so lēg nevet liwo lēnlon, ba til veteg kē n̄a lelam. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />So namnē wo mak nēk misisgoy legengenyeg, nitiy wē yeh so nēk helm̄ēt. Itōk ēwē hiy nēk so namne wo vitwag ēwē ba nēk tavan lēh lap, veteg den namne wo vōyō ba nēk tavan amnō, a lelo ep mey a tit bah vēhte. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Mahē nan nōl tētēhiy nataqn̄ēy, ba nōl nan tit mat vēhte; wa nep nan tit mat vēhte.<verse eid="MRK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />“So nayn̄ē wo mak nēk misisgoy legengenyeg, itōk so nēk tot m̄ēt. Itōk ēwē hiy nēk so nayn̄ē wo vitwag ēwē ba nēk tavan lēh lap, veteg den nayn̄ē wo vōyō ba nēk tavan amnō. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Mahē nan nōl tētēhiy nataqn̄ēy, ba nōl nan tit mat vēhte; wa nep nan tit mat vēhte.<verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />“Sowo namte wo mak nēk misisgoy legengenyeg, itōk so nēk lepyak. Itōk ēwē hiy nēk so namte wo vitwag ēwē ba nēk tavan lemyeyen talge non Ḡod, veteg den namte wo vōyō ba nēk tavan amnō. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Mahē nan nōl tētēhiy nataqn̄ēy, ba nōl nan tit mat vēhte; wa nep nan tit mat vēhte.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Ḡod qoyo ak wenwen ige del mi nep qeleso net nitēymat negengen mi nanaw so niolol aē. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Nanaw nitiy wē yeh so m̄ōk legengen. Ba nanaw nan wo nemlele en, kē tit gon lok vēhte. Atmi ak neh nonmi nivan me qeleso nanaw, tō atmi qultiwag galsi mi natm̄at.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="rem">Cleaned up 10:1-45 for Anglican lectionary with Colenso and Laisa 9 September 2024</para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mohole gatay nēvēlwoy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Tigsas mavan den Kapaniam, tō nivan me lepnō liwo Judea, tō kē nivan tekel Bē Lon̄ Jordan. Ba nisil liwo mavan me hiy Tigsas tō kē nivatvatne kēy bohohole non Ḡod, a qele vaga en. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Tō yatkel Farisi mavan me hiy Tigsas wa mēvēhge nēvēvēhiy van hiy kē so ak sisgoy kē. Kēy mavap van hiy Tigsas so, “?Qeleave? ?Net vitwag sowo mēvēlwoy den ēgnōn en, kē natatag Nele?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Ba Tigsas nivēhge lok van hiy ige Farisi so, “?Nahan le a Mosis melep tō van hiy kimi ōk?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ige Farisi mavap so, “Mosis mukēg aē so net tēvēlwoy vēh ēgnōn, ba kē niyap vasem hōw loyobem ne vēlwoy en, tō nilep van hiy ēgnōn, tō kōyō vēlwoy.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Mosis mayap Nele nen van hiy kimi veg niqtimi namaymay wowoh. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ba me am̄ag, mahē Ḡod mitin̄ namyam en, Nayapyap Yon̄ non Ḡod mavap so, ‘Ḡod mitin̄ net vōyō, vitwag natm̄an ba vitwag nalqōvēn.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ba Ḡod vap so, ‘Veg bege gōh en, natm̄an nivan yak den imam wa tita nonon, tō kē niqultiwag van mi ēgnōn. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Tō kōyō van me qeleso nataqn̄ige vitwag woy.’ Bastō kōyō et vōyō site, ba kōyō van me qeleso nataqn̄ige vitwag woy ēwē. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Mahē a Ḡod niqultiwag kōyō en, net nitog vēlwoy lokse neleg noyō.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Vētmahē a Tigsas tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy mavan lok lēm̄, kēy mēvēhge lokse Tigsas aē a bēvēlwoy en. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Net a nivēlwoy den ēgnōn tō kē nileg leh mi nalqōvēn tegha en, kē nisisgoy legengenyeg, veg tiy ēgnōn aē. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Tō nalqōvēn se qeleanen, kē nivēlwoy den ēgnōn tō kē nileg leh mi natm̄an tegha en, kē nisisgoy se legengenyeg.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nivawē ige susu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Yatkel et mavantēy me ige nētnētm̄ey nonoy hiy Tigsas so kē nitan̄ apwoy, tō so nivawē kēy. Ba ige nonon magatgoy kēy. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ba Tigsas met van qelegōh en, tō kē mohole maymay, wa mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi nitog gatgatgoy ige nētnētm̄ey agōh! Atmi ukēg ige nētnētm̄ey van me hiy no, veg namyeyen non Ḡod non ige a qele ige nētnētm̄ey agōh. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Hēyhēywē nok vap van hiy kimi, net wo et malaklak te so nim̄ōk hiy nēdēmdēm nonon qele ige nētnētm̄ey en, kē tit van vēhte me lemyeyen mey a so Ḡod nimyanag goy.”<verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Tō Tigsas moyveg goy kēy mē, tō nim̄ōk namnen apwoy, tō nivawē kēy.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Net m̄eye haphap vitwag nemyōs so nitēy nēh lap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Tigsas so nivan den mahē nen wah, net vitwag nigityak me hiy kē. Net nan mavatiqaw hōw lengon Tigsas. Tō kē nivēhge Tigsas wo, “!Vatgo! Inēk net ēwē vitwag. ?No tak qeleave so nok tēy nēh lap?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Tigsas meplu goy kē so, “?Bahap tō nēk ōl no so ino nēwē? Ḡod mahgen, ikē nēwē. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Nēk mal ēglal vatag Nele non Ḡod a mavap so, ‘Nēk nitog wuwuh mat net. Nitog mitimtiy tiwag mi ēgnōn net tegha. Nitog tan̄tan̄hephep. Nitog galgal. Nitog vēgal. Nēk dēmap imam wa tita nōnōm.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Tō net nan mavap van hiy Tigsas so, “Vatgo. No natatag Nele del anen, meqtēg yak tō me a no nusu, gaydēn̄ qiyig agōh.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Tigsas natam yeh net nan, tō kē met kē van ba mavap so, “Nage vitwag lapgetō a nēk et ak qete. Nēk van ba n̄eyeg qēt nahaphap del nōnōm, tō lep nēsēm nan van hiy ige m̄asay, tō nahaphap nōnōm tam̄adeg hag alge en. Nēk dam no, tō van me net mino.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Tigsas mohole bah qelegōh en, tō net nan mat tēqēl nangon, veg kē moyon̄ ninhet aē, wa nēdēmdēm nonon mēqēt, veg ikē nam̄ye haphap. Tō kē nivan veteg Tigsas.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nemeh mi net a nam̄ye haphap, so nihayveg lemyeyen non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Tō Tigsas met van hiy ige tin̄qoy nonon en, tō mavap van hiy kēy so, “Nemeh hiy net m̄eye haphap so nihayveg hay lemyeyen non Ḡod.”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ige non Tigsas mamamakē aē bohohole agōh, tō Tigsas mavap lokse van hiy kēy so, “Yēhē yantintik, nememeh yeh veg net so nivan me lemyeyen non Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ba nitiy memeh yeh veg net m̄eye haphap so nivan me lemyeyen non Ḡod, qele nakamel nikal heylō namtem̄lō ne il susuy.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ba ige non Tigsas mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn veg bohohole nonon en. Tō kēy vēy vēvēhge kēy wo, “?Ba ihē tētēy vēh nēh lap?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Tō Tigsas met van hiy kēy, ba mavap van so, “Nage nen net tit ak vēhte. Ḡod mahgen tak vēh, veg kē tak vēh vel haphap del.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ba Pita mavap van hiy kē wo, “?Ba qeleave veg kemem? !Kemem mukēg qēt vel haphap del nonmem tō so dam nēk!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Nok vap van hiy kimi nēhēyhēywē. Net a niukēg nēm̄ nonon, yathēthēn, yatētētan, tita wa imam nonon, ige nētnētm̄ey nonon si nēvētan del nonon veg no wa Boyoy Ēwē en, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />nahaphap nonon tam̄adeg yeh. Kē telep m̄eldēl den vel haphap a kē mavan veteg tō en. Hēywē nok vap van hiy kimi, lemyam gōh, net nen qoyo lep nēm̄ m̄adeg, yathēthēn nam̄adeg, yatētētan nam̄adeg, tita nam̄adeg, nēnētm̄ey nam̄adeg, wa nēvētan nam̄adeg. Ba ige sil tak nehet hiy kē. Ba lemyam gayaq a vanvan lapgetō me en, kē tētēy nēh a tit bah vēhte. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Woqse et a nahag letno liwo qiyig gōh kē en, kēy tēhēw tēqēl n̄a antan. Ba ige a nahag antan en, kēy tēvēykal me alge.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavasemlō so kē tamat.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige sil mavan kal hag Jerusalem. Ba Tigsas mitig helem̄ag kēy, wa ige nonon madam kē. Tō kēy mamakē aē a nēkēkēn veg kē. Ba ige sil a madam tō kēy me en, kēy memtēgteg qēt. Tō Tigsas melep tiwag me ige nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō, tō mohole yoyon̄ van hiy kēy veg vel haphap a taqal kē hag Jerusalem en. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi yon̄teg, gēn vanvan hag Jerusalem ēgēn. Mahē nen, yatkel et qoyo m̄ōk Ēntēn Net van lemnen ige m̄agoy ige pris wa ige vatvatgo Bele. Ige gōh qoyo vēvēg kē so nimat, tō kēy tōm̄ōk kē van lemnen ige lolqōn̄. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Ige gōh toboyboyheg kē, tinihgeg kē, kēy telm̄eh kē wa tuwuh mat kē. Ba lōqōn̄ vētēl negi en, kē tēh lokse.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jemes kōyō Jon mēvēhge nēvēvēhiy van hiy Tigsas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yoge yantēntēn Sēbēdē, Jemes wa Jon, kōyō mavan me hiy Tigsas, ba mēvēhge kē van wo, “?Vatgo, nēk tak vēh namyōs nonmamyō?”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kōyō so, “?Kōmyō nemyōs so nok ak nahap van hiy kōmyō?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Yoge nan mavap so, “Kamyō nemyōs so mahē Ḡod nilep kal nēk letno liwo nemayanag nōnōm en, nēk m̄ōk kamyō, vitwag nihag lemtō nōnōm ba vitwag nihag legla nōnōm.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ba Tigsas mavap van hiy kōyō so, “Kōmyō et ēglal te nahap a kōmyō vēhge tō anen. ?Kōmyō toyon̄memeh vēh lataqn̄ēmōyō, qele nok so yon̄memeh ōk? ?Kōmyō tin vēh livinlah a nok so in aē, wa lavasugyon̄ a nok so vasugyon̄ aē ōk?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Kōyō meplu goy Tigsas so, “O-oh, kamyō tak vēh.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Hēywē, kōmyō vap qeleanen. Kōmyō tin vēh livinlah a nok so in aē en, wa tavasugyon̄ vēh kōmyō lavasugyon̄ ne yon̄memeh a nok so lep en. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ba kōmyō mēvēhge no so vitwag den kōmyō nihag lemtō mino wa vitwag legla mino en, et muk te so nok lep van hiy kōmyō. Veg Ḡod mal tēymat vatag mahē hiy ige nonon a kē mal etyak kēy.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Mahē a ige nonon bul son̄wul moyon̄teg nohohole noyō en, tō kēy mololgagay Jemes ba Jon aē. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Tō Tigsas niōlōl kēy me tō nivap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi mal ēglal vatag nēmētwun ige lolqōn̄. Ige a so mayanag goy kēy en, namtevuy namaymay, tō ige lililwo nonoy ak memeh ēwē kēy. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ba et haytēyēh te so kimi ak qeleanen. Sowo net vitwag den kimi nemyōs so nilwo goy kimi en, kē tavan me net mugumguteg non ige del. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Wa net a nemyōs so nitig helem̄ag kimi en, kē tavan me qeleso neslev nonmi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Veg Ēntēn Net en, kē et van te me so ige sil ak namgumgu nonon. Ba kē mavan me so nimgumgu hiy ige sil, wa so niukēg nēh nonon so niwēl namtehal non ige sil so lep nēh lap.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="rem">reviewed for lectionary 10:46-52 Oct 2021</para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mak wē namtan Batimeas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy nonon mavan heylō me Jeriko, ba mahē a kēy mavan veteg Jeriko, nisil liwo madam tatag Tigsas. Ba net matbē vitwag nahag sili metehal, nahan Batimeas. Net gōh ēntēn Timeas, vaga kē nivēvēhge nēsēm den net a kē nivan sisqet kē me en. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Mahē a namatbē nan moyon̄teg so Tigsas Tanasaret navanvan tō metehal en, tō kē niqtēg ōlōl Tigsas. Kē mavap so, “!Tigsas! !Ēntēn Devēt! !Nēk magaysēn no!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Woqse et mohole boel kē, wa mavap so, “!Togtog yon̄!” Ba kē et tog yon̄ te ba mōlōl liwo malig se hag, ba mavap so, “!Tigsas! !Inēk Ēntēn Devēt! !Nēk magaysēn no!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Tigsas mitighiy, ba mavap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi ōlōl kē me.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Tō kēy vap van hiy namatbē nan so, “Itōk, nēk hatig. Tigsas niōlōl nēk so van me hiy kē.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Namatbē nan moyow hatig den natnon, ba musuwyeg veteg namalmal a kē matatyip goy tō kē aē, tō nivan me hiy Tigsas ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Tigsas mēvēhge namatbē nan wo, “?Nēk nemyōs so nok ak nahap van hiy nēk?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Tō kē meplu so, “Vatgo, no nemyōs so nok etet lok.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “Itōk, nēk van, Ḡod mal ak wē nēk, veg nēdēmtig nōnōm namaymay.” Vag tiwag ēwē kē metet lok, tō madam tatag Tigsas lemtehal.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas makalbat Jerusalem, so niaklō kē so kē namyanag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Mahē a Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon vanvan sisqet me Jerusalem en, ba kēy mavan lōme Luwutwut Ne Olif. Ba kēy tigtig mahē nen ba etet tēqēl hōw lepnō susu vōyō, napnō nan Betfas ba Betani. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy yoge vōyō nonon so, “Atmōyō van tēqēl yow lepnō nōk, ba kōmyō tetsas nodon̄kē lōmgep vitwag a net et hag qete apwon, ba kēy nēyēt maymay kē. Atmōyō tuw yak nagayga den kē, ba van tēy me hiy no. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />So net wo mēvēhge kōmyō so, ‘?Kōmyō melep nodon̄kē gōh bahap?’ ba kōmyō vap van hiy net nan so, ‘Welan so niak namgumgu namun aē. Ba kē qoyo vētleg lok me.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Tō kōyō van me, tō vansas nodon̄kē lōmgep nen tigtō metehal, a kēy nēyēt maymay kē sisqet namte-ēm̄ ne ēm̄ vitwag. Mahē kōyō tuwtuwyak nagayga den nodon̄kē nen, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />ba yatkel et a tig gehtō en, kēy vēhge van hiy kōyō so, “!Ēy! ?Bahap tō kōmyō mutuwyak van nagayga den nodon̄kē nen?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Tō kōyō vap van hiy kēy nohohole a Tigsas mavap tō van hiy kōyō en, tō ige nan ukēg, tō kōyō van. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Kōyō mēdēn̄ lok me nen, tō lep van nodon̄kē nan hiy Tigsas. Tō kōyō vahyeg neleleh bomomyiy noyō apwo don̄kē nan, tō Tigsas nihag ketket hag apwon ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Woqse sil mavan se me tō vahyeg se neleleh nonoy lemtehal a lengon Tigsas. Ba yatkel et me vey niwti qētēnge lōlhiy namtehal a nayoy aē, a kēy motot hēyēt. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Woqse sil mavan am̄ag lengon Tigsas. Ba woqse sil se madam tatag kē, kēy ōlōl so, “!Ōliwo Ḡod! !Hosana! Ḡod, nēk vawē net agōh, kē mavan me lahan Welan Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />!Ḡod nēk vawē namyanag gayaq mey a telep natno liwo non yatqōtqōnmem Devēt! !Hosana! !Gēn ōliwo Ḡod alge!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Tigsas mēdēn̄ me Jerusalem en, tō nihayveg hay Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod. Kē met qēt bah nahaphap del hay lēm̄ en, tō Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō m̄ōl lok Betani, veg nalo mal van.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēqētēnge fik vitwag et ō te nēwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Taval meyen nan hag en, kēy hatig den Betani tō vanvan me hiy Jerusalem nen, ba namaygay mak Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Tō Tigsas met nēqētēnge fik tigtō a yeh ba nayon a nemtōqtōq. Tō Tigsas nivan so niet tow so nēwan aē. Ba mahē a Tigsas mavan sisqet me, kē met hag en vēlēs yon geh, veg et wōl nan qete a so kē niō nēwan. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Tō Tigsas mohole van hiy nēqētēnge en so, “Net tit gen vēhte nēwe n̄ēh te.” Ba ige nonon moyon̄teg nohohole a kē mavap en.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mōvōylōlō ige a kēy n̄eyen̄yeg wa veleplet haphap Lēm̄ non Ḡod.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Mahē a kēy mēdēn̄ me Jerusalem en, Tigsas nivan me Nitiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod. Tō kē niqtēg vōylōlō ige a kēy veleplet wa n̄eyen̄yeg nahaphap hay lelo geay Ēm̄ non Ḡod en. Tigsas matam vēli netebol non ige leleh sēm, tiwag mi natno haghag non ige a kēy n̄eyen̄yeg noqon. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Ba Tigsas et ukēg te so net nivantēy nahaphap namun lō me lelo geay Ne Ēm̄ non Ḡod so nin̄yeg. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Tō Tigsas mavatne kēy so, “Atmi et. Mayap tō aē Lōbōk Yon̄ non Ḡod a mavap so, ‘Nēm̄ mino, ige sil tavap so nēm̄ tatay non ige vel vōnō del lemyam.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 56:7</char></note> Ba kimi mak tō kē mavan me ‘natno taqtaqbat non ige et belbel.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jeremiah 7:11</char></note> ”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Mahē a ige m̄agoy ige pris tiwag mi ige vatvatgo Bele moyon̄teg noyoy bege gōh en, tō kēy qētēg sok namtehal so wuh mat kē aē. Ba kēy mētēgteg kē, veg mahē kē nivatvatne en, ige sil mamamakē aē veg bohohole nonon. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Tō lemyēpyep nen, Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon hatig tō van lokse den nataon nen.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēqētēnge fik, kē nileplō me namaymay ne dēmtig Kraēs.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Talōw nan hag nen, kēy mahatig a lemtap qōtō, kēy vanvan me metehal nen wah, kēy et van qelekē nēqētēnge fik a kē mivipdeg tō en mal seygol dēn̄ a lōgōygōyyēn. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pita mēdēm lok nohohole non Tigsas, tō kē mavap so, “Vatgo, nēk et. Nēqētēnge a nēk mivipdeg tō anoy en mal seygol.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi dēmtig Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nok vap van hiy kimi nēhēyhēywē. So net vitwag wo nēdēmtig maymay Ḡod en, tō kē nivap van hiy natō liwo gōh so, ‘Nēk hatig, ba yow n̄a lenaw,’ tō Ḡod toyon̄teg kē. Sowo nēdēmtig nonon et vōvōyō te, ba kē nēdēmtig so nohohole a kē mavap en, tak tig, tō Ḡod tak tatag qele a net nan mavap en. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />So kimi wo matatay hiy Ḡod bahapte, ba dēmtig so Ḡod mal lep van hiy kimi, tō Ḡod telep van hiy kimi. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Kimi wo moboel net vitwag, tiy wē yeh so kimi dēmveteg nēmgōn am̄ag den kimi tig kal hag ba tatay. Tō Ḡod Imam nonmi hag alge en qoyo dēmveteg nimgumi. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />So kimi wo et dēmveteg te nēmgōn ige tegha en, Imam nonmi hag alge en tit dēmveteg vēhte nimgumi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige m̄agoy Tisrael et ēglal galsi te namgumgu namun Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon mavan lokse me Jerusalem. Mahē Tigsas nivanvan sisqet me Nitiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod nen, ba ige m̄agoy olol tiwag mi ige vatvatgo Bele wa ige lililwo goy ige Tisrael van me tō et Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Ige gōh mēvēhge van hiy Tigsas so, “?Nēk ak tō namgumgu namu nen ihē me lep van? ?Ihē mukēg nēk aē so nēk ak namgumgu geh nen?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Tō Tigsas meplu goy kēy so, “Itōk, nok vēhge se nēvēvēhiy vitwag van hiy kimi. Kimi wo meplu goy nēvēvēhiy namuk gōh en, tō no tavasemlō van hiy kimi so ihē mōm̄ōk no so nok ak namgumgu gōh. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Atmi vasemlō tow me hiy no. ?Wō Jon mavavasugyon̄ ige et en, Ḡod mavap van hiy kē so niak, si net mavap van hiy kē?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Tō kēy vēy hohole veg bēvēvēhiy namun Tigsas ēgēn. Kēy vap so, “?Ba gēn tavap qeleave? So gēn wo mavap so Ḡod mavap van hiy kē so niak qelenen, tō kē tavap so, ‘O-oh. ?Ba qeleave tō kimi et dēmtig te Jon?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ba gēn tit vap vēhte so, ‘Net mavayēg kē aē.’ ” Kēy vap qelenen veg kēy mal dēmtig vatag so Jon, ikē net lēgēlgēg non Ḡod.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Tō kēy meplu goy Tigsas so, “Kemem et ēglal te.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Ba ino se, no tit vasemlō vēhte van hiy kimi, so ihē mōm̄ōk no so nok ak namgumgu gōh.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavap tēngeg veg ige het betetgoy tēqē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Tigsas mohohole van hiy ige lililwo Tisrael a lavap tēngeg. Kē wo, “Net vitwag mak nētqē ne gayga vitwag ōl so krēp (a kēy akak nawaen aē en). Tō kēy megeay walēg goy, ba migil naqyan̄ vitwag so niqōs managnag nēwe krēp aē, tō nēglēn nivan me nawaen ēgēn. Ba net nan mētēy kal se nēm̄ vitwag veg ige betetgoy tēqē so tog aē. Tō me atgiy, kē mōm̄ōk yatkel et lētqē nen so kēy mugumgu aē. Mahē nēkrēp so nimta en̄, kēy lepyak nonon tekelgi wa nonoy tekelgi. Tō me atgiy en, net nan nivan ba tatal lepnō tegha ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mahē a nēwe krēp memta en, net benon tēqē nivētleg me net bemgumgu mamah nonon vitwag hiy ige etetgoy tēqē en, so kēy lep tekel krēp me hiy kē. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ba kēy hatig hag nen, tō tēy kē, lem̄eh kē, tō vētleg lok kē. Ba kēy et lep te hap te van hiy kē. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Tō welan nivētleg lokse me net nonon vitwag se, ba kēy malam̄ metewot nēqtēn, ba mak hiy kē a nehet. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Tō net benon tēqē mēvētleg lokse net vitwag nonon se, tō kēy wuh mat kē. Yatkel et nonon se a nam̄adeg, ba kēy mak hiy kēy a nehet. Yatkelgi kēy melm̄elm̄eh kēy ba yatkelgi kēy muwuh matmat kēy. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Ba net nonon togoy vitwag woy a so kē nivētleg kē babah negi. Net gōh en, ikē tiy ēntēn a kē natam yeh kē. Tō kē nivētleg kē hiy kēy. Lēdēmdēm nonon en so, ‘Ige gōh tēdēmap intik.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Ba kēy vap so, ‘Igōhkē ēntēn net a nētqē nonon agōh. Ikē gōh tilwo goy nētqē agōh. Gēn van wuh mat kē, tō nētqē nan nongēn ge.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Bahnentō kēy van tō tēy maymay kē, wuh mat kē, tō kēy suwyeg lō nataqn̄ēn den nētqē ēgēn.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige lililwo Tisrael so, “?Ba net gōh tak nahap van hiy ige etgoy tēqē en? Net nan qoyo wuh matmat qēt kēy, tō kē nilep van nētqē gōh lemnen ige tegha. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Kimi wun et vatah qete Nabaebol. Navavap non Ḡod mavap so, ‘Nahan̄ a ige bētēytēy ēm̄ musuwyeg tō en, kē mavan me nahan̄ mey a nitiy wē yeh. <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ḡod mak nahan̄ gōh mavan me nam̄e han̄, tō gēn met nitiy wē yeh.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Tō ige lililwo goy ige Tisrael nemyōs so tēy Tigsas, veg kēy moyon̄teg vēglal so Tigsas hole tō en veg kēy. Ba kēy mētēgteg ige et. Tō kēy vayak den kē ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige Farisi me vēhge Tigsas so, “?Itōk so net niwēl natakis van hiy Sisa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Me atgiy ige lililwo nonoy mēvētleg yatkel Farisi tiwag mi yatkel et a kēy nemyin̄ ige non Mayanag Herod, so kēy van me so vēhge nēvēvēhiy van hiy Tigsas so ak sisgoy kē. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Tō kēy van me met Tigsas, tō mavap van hiy kē so, “Vatgo. Kemem nēglal so inēk net tenenen vitwag. Nēk et mētēgteg te ige et, veg nēk et dēmdēm te aē so net liwo si net su. Nohohole nōnōm nēhēyhēywē vēlēs, wa nēk vatvatne ige sil lemtehal a Ḡod nemyōs. Tō kemem nemyōs so ēglal. ?Wō itōk Lele nongēn so gēn wēl natakis van hiy Sisa si tateh?” (Veg Sisa nage Torom ba kē namyanag goy vel vōnō.)<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ba Tigsas mal ēglal so kēy galgal ēwē kē. Tō Tigsas mavap so, “?Bahap tō kimi akak etgal so ak sisgoy no qelegōh? Atmi lep tow me nēsēm vitwag, nok et tow.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Tō kēy lep van nēsēm hiy kē, tō Tigsas mēvēhge van hiy kēy so, “?Ba nangon hē aē kē? ?Wa nahah gōh en nahan hē?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Tō kēy vap so, “Nangon Sisa anen, bastō nahan se.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Namlan Sisa, atmi lep lok van hiy Sisa. Namlan Ḡod, atmi lep lok van hiy Ḡod.” Tō kēy mamamakē aē bohohole nonon agōh.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">?Qeleave veg net a kē niēh lok den namatmat?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Yatkel Sadusi mavan me hiy Tigsas. Ige Sadusi et dēmtig te so Ḡod tak ēh lok ige mey a mal mat vatag. Ige Sadusi gōh mēvēhge nēvēvēhiy vitwag van hiy Tigsas so, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Vatgo. Mosis mayap hōw Lele nongēn so natm̄an vitwag wo mamat veteg ēgnōn, ba ēntēyō wo tateh, tō ēthēn nileg lok mi nanay en. Tō nalqōvēn wo melep ēntēn en, tō kē nivan me qeleso ēntēn natm̄an mey a mal mat en. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ba mahē nen ige mata yathēy buliviyō. Nowotwotm̄ag me leg, tō kē mamat veteg ēgnōn, ba ēntēyō tateh. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Tō wotwot mehiy meleg mi nanay nan, tō kē mamat se a ēntēn tateh, tō vētēl negi se qelenen. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Gaydēn̄ a ige buliviyō nen meleg mi nalqōvēn vitwag anen, ba kēy mamat qēt a ēntēy tateh. Tō me atgiy en, nalqōvēn nan nimat. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Tō veg ige mata yathēy buliviyō gōh meleg tō mi nalqōvēn en, ?Ba, babah ne qōn̄ a ige sil hatig lokse den namatmat en, tō ihē den kēy telep nalqōvēn en?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Nohohole nonmi et tenenen te. ?Kimi nēglal so bahap? Nohohole nonmi et tenenen te, veg kimi et ēglal te Nayapyap Yon̄ non Ḡod, wa kimi et ēglal te naman non Ḡod. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Mahē ige et mat hatig lokse den namatmat en, kēy tit legleg lok vēhte, nelegleg tabah. Kēy tavan me qele ige in̄sel hag alge en. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Namtehal ne ēhēh lokse den namatmat, van lōbōk non Mosis, a kē mayap tō aē veg nēqētēnge su a nep nilawlaw aē. Lēvēt mahē nen, Ḡod mavap van hiy Mosis so, ‘Ino Ḡod non Abraham, wa ino Ḡod non Isak, wa ino Ḡod non Jakop.’ ?Kimi wun meptah sas ba et ēglal qete nohohole agōh? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ba Ḡod gōh, ikē Ḡod non ige a kēy nēh, ikē et Ḡod non ige et mat te. Nēdēmdēm nonmi a yeh tewiwi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nele non Ḡod a nitiy wē yeh den vel Le del</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Navatgo Bele vitwag mahaldin̄qoy vel hohole del gōh. Wa kē moyon̄teg napluplu non Tigsas a nitiy wē yeh. Tō kē mavan me hiy Tigsas, ba mēvēhge nēvēvēhiy vitwag van hiy kē wo, “?Nahan Le non Ḡod a nitiy wē yeh den vel Le del?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Cleaned up Mark 12:28-44 for lectionary with Colenso and Laisa 9 Sept 2024</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “Nele mey a nitiy wē yeh qelegēn, ‘!Ige yatqōtqōn Israel, atmi yon̄teg galsi! Welan, ikē Ḡod nongēn, wa ikē mahgen a Newelan en. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Atmi tam Welan Ḡod nonmi mi natqami del, mi natalami del, mi nēdēmdēm del nonmi, wa mi namaymay nonmi del.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ba nele vōyō negi den vel Le, mavap so, ‘Kimi tam galsi vel et a tog walēg tō kimi en, atmi ak nahaphap mey nēwē hiy kēy, qele kimi ak nahaphap mey nēwē lokse hiy kimi.’ Tateh le tegha se a nēwē veteg nele vōyō agōh.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Tō navatgo Bele nan meplu so, “Vatgo, nohohole nōnōm netnenen. Nahap a nēk mavap en, ikē hēywē. Ḡod gōh, ikē vitwag woy, tateh Ḡod tegha se. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Itōk so gēn tam galsi Ḡod lelo taqangēn mi nēdēmdēm del nongēn wa mi namaymay del nongēn. Wa itōk so gēn tam galsi se ige a kēy notog walēg gēn, tō ak nahaphap mey nēwē hiy kēy, qele igēn vivitwag ak nahap mey nēwē hiy gēn lokse. Mahē gēn tatag goy galsi nele vōyō gōh en, tō gēn ak nahap mey a nitiy wē yeh. Meygōh itōk veteg nolol del a gēn leplep van hiy Ḡod.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Tigsas moyon̄teg van a nohohole non net gōh netnenen en, tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kē so, “Nēk mal van sisqet me lemyeyen non Ḡod, a so kē nimyanag goy nēk.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Me atgiy en, nataqn̄ēy ige lililwo Tujuw mamamayge. Tō kēy et vēhge site nēvēvēhiy den Tigsas.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kraēs, ikē ēntēn Devēt, ba ikē welan nonon se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Mahē Tigsas mavatvatne ige sil hay Litiy Ēm̄ Bolol hiy Ḡod en, tō kē mēvēhge nēvēvēhiy vitwag van hiy kēy so, “?Bahap tō ige vatvatgo Bele vap so Kraēs, ikē ēntēn Devēt? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Nuvu Yon̄ mohole heylō Devēt, tō Devēt mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Ḡod mavap van hiy Welan mino so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">“Nēk hag me lemtō mino a laqaqayek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">gaydēn̄ a nok m̄ōk tēqēl ige tavale nōnōm tōm̄ōk kēy laln̄e yēn̄ēk.” ’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Mayanag Devēt mōl Kraēs so Welan. ?Tō qeleave tō Kraēs gōh, ikē ēntēn Devēt?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Tō nisil nam̄adeg a nam̄adeg, kēy memlaklak boyon̄yon̄teg nohohole non Tigsas.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mohole tigoy ige vatvatgo Bele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mahē Tigsas mavatvatne ige gōh en, tō kē mavap so, “Kimi etgoy galgalsi kimi den ige vatvatgo Bele. Kēy sēsē kēy so hey namalmal hoyohyo a mēwēwē bah. Wa letno n̄eyen̄yeg haphap en, kēy nemyōs so ige et hog kal namney hiy kēy, so dēmap kēy. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Wa hay lēm̄ tatay en, kēy nemyōs so haghiy lamahē mey nēwē, wa legengen liwo se qelenen. Kēy nemyōs so haghiy letno haghag non ige lililwo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ba kēy akak magaysēn ige nay, veg kēy tan̄tan̄hephep lēm̄ nonoy. Me atgiy en, kēy tatay a nehyo telm̄ētm̄ēt, ak so ige sil dēmap kēy. Ba kēy telep nēvēvēg liwo aē n̄ēh.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nalqōvēn nay musuwyeg nalen̄a namun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Tō Tigsas mahag namun sisqet natno suwsuwyeg sey alen̄a. Ba kē nietet ige a kēy suwsuwyeg nalen̄a namuy. Ba woqse m̄eye sēm, kēy suwsuwyeg nēsēm namuy a nēkēkēn. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ba nalqōvēn nay vitwag, kē nem̄say, kē mahayveg me ba musuwyeg namun nēsēm susu vōyō woy.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Tō Tigsas mōlōl ige nonon mavan me hiy kē, tō kē mavap van hiy kēy so, “Hēywē, nok vap van hiy kimi, nalen̄a namun nalqōvēn nay gōh nitiy liwo veteg namun ige del. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Veg ige m̄eye sēm gōh en, kēy suwyeg van nēsēm liwo ba kēy metey goy tekel sēm nonoy. Ba nalqōvēn m̄asay gōh, kē musuwyeg qēt nēsēm nonon, a kē so niwēl negengen nagan aē.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Nitiy Ēm̄ Yon̄ non Ḡod n̄a Jerusalem tehet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Tigsas mavan den Nitiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod en, tō nitin̄qoy vitwag nonon mavap van hiy kē so, “Vatgo, nēk et. Nevet del ne Ēm̄ non Ḡod gōh nilililwo geh, ba nēm̄ nan mēwēwē geh bah.”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="rem">Cleaned up 13:1-8 for lectionary with Colenso and Laisa 9 September 2024.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Tō Tigsas meplu goy kē wo, “?Nēk etet hiy nēm̄ lililwo gōh? Vel ēm̄ geh nen tatamyuy qēt, nevet del geh nen, n̄a lēvētan. Tateh vet nihag letnon, kēy tisisisgoy qēt tiwag mi nēm̄ del.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēvēglal a so sisqet Nēm̄ non Ḡod tisisgoy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Me atgiy, Tigsas mahag n̄a wotō, nahan Wutwut Ne Olif, tō etet tēqēl hōw Lēm̄ non Ḡod. Tō Pita, Jemes, Jon, wa Andrō, kēy van me hiy Tigsas, kēy bul tēvēlēm tiwag mi kē. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />Tō kēy vēhge van hiy Tigsas wo, “?Wō nahaphap geh gōh tavan me n̄ēh? ?Ba kemem tet vēglal nēvēglal nan qeleave mahē aso nōqōn̄ nan nivan me?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Tō Tigsas meplu goy kēy so, “Atmi etetgoy galsi kimi, veg net tiple galgal kimi. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Veg woqse et tavan me lehek, tō tavap so, ‘Ino gōh Kraēs.’ Ige gōh tagalgal woqse et. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ba mahē kimi wo moyon̄teg noyoy ne vagal, wa nohohole soloteg bepgal so nivan me en, kimi nitog mētēgteg. Nahaphap geh nen tavan me am̄ag, ba et nolsēn qete. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Yatkel vōnō totogtog tavale, wa yatkel lelqelqevōnō tepgal mi ige lelqelqevōnō tegha. Niyiy tiyiy yatkel vōnō lemyam. Wa namay tak ige sil. Vel haphap geh gōh, kēy tavan me am̄ag, ba meygōh naqtēqtēg ne memeh mey a tavan me. Nēvēglal geh gōh qeleso nalqōvēn vitwag mey a niyon̄yon̄ memeh so nilep ēntēn.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Atmi etetgoy galsi kimi. Ige sil tētēy kimi, wa kēy tētēy nōyōstiwag liwo so vēvēg kimi. Wa kēy telm̄eh kimi hay lēm̄ tatay non ige Tisrael. Wa kēy tohohole maymay hiy kimi so tig van lengon ige lililwo non kapman, wa lengon ige qēt mayanag. Veg kimi ige mino, ba kimi vasemlō noyoy mino van hiy kēy. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ba kimi toytoy Noyoy Ēwē am̄ag hiy ige sil walēg namyam, tō nage gōh qoyo van me.<verse eid="MRK 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />“Ba kēy tētēy kimi, ba kimi nitog dēmdēm van aē, so kimi tohole qeleave lōyōstiwag. Ḡod telep van nohohole a so kimi so hole. Kimi tit hole vēhte mahgemi. Ba Nuvu Yon̄ qoyo hole heylō kimi. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Net tukēg vēh tiy ēthēn van lemney so kēy wuh mat kē. Imam tukēg vēh yantēntēn so kēy wuh mat kēy. Tō ige nētnētm̄ey tetvale goy imam wa tita nonoy, wa kēy tukēg kōyō so kēy wuh mat kōyō. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Ba ige sil tepsipteg kimi wa tetvale goy kimi, veg kimi madam tatag no. Ba Ḡod tavaēh ihēte a kē nidēmtig tasga no gaydēn̄ a babah ne qōn̄.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mohole gatay nahaphap het tavan me Lēm̄ non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />(Ige a kēy vatah nōbōk gōh, kēy dēmdēm galsi bevel hohole a Tigsas mavap tō.) Tigsas mavap so, “Daniel mohohole nahaphap het a tak hethet Nitiy Ēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod. Ba kimi tet nage nan titig n̄a Lēm̄ non Ḡod. Mahē kimi et nage gōh en, kimi a togtō Judea en, atmi gityak n̄a wotō geh gēn ba taqbat. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />So net wo et hag te lelo ēm̄ nonon en, kē tit hayveg lok vēhte lēm̄ nonon, so nilep nahaphap nonon. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />So net wo lētqē nonon en, kē tit m̄ōl lok vēhte lēm̄ so nivēl namalmal nonon. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ba nemgaysēn yeh veg ige lōqōvēn a notog mi natqay, wa ige a titi lapgetō nisis van hiy ige yantēntēy, kēy toyon̄teg a nehet yeh lamahē anen. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ba atmi tatay veg nahaphap het gōh tit qal vēhte kimi lamahē a nayay nililip nivan me.”<verse eid="MRK 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />“Veg lamahē nen nahaphap het nan tavan me, ba net etet qete nage qelenen me am̄ag, meqtēg yak me a Ḡod mitin̄ namyam gaydēn̄ me qiyig agōh. Bastō tateh haphap het liwo se qelenen nivan lokse me an̄ēhte. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ba Ḡod mal dēmvasig bah, so nilep tēqēl me mahē a so nōqōn̄ ne haphap het nivan me aē. Tateh tō en, togtō tateh et niēh. Ba veg kē melep tēqēl namahē nan, tō so nivaēh nisil a kē mal etyak vatag kēy so ige nonon. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Lamahē nen, net tavap van hiy kimi so, ‘Net gōh, ikē Kraēs.’ Si net tegha tavap van hiy kimi so, ‘Net nōk, ikē Kraēs.’ Ba atmi nitog dēmdēmtig kēy van. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Woqse Kraēs galgal, wa woqse et lēgēlgēg galgal kēy tavan me, tak naphah wa tak nahaphap mey a nisil tamamakē aē so kēy tak vēh. Kēy tak qele gōh so akak etgal so gal ige a Ḡod mal etyak vatag kēy so ige nonon. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Nok vasemlō vel haphap gōh van hiy kimi am̄ag, tō kimi so etgoy galgalsi kimi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ēntēn Net tavan lok me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Mahē nahaphap het gōh nibah en, nalo nivan me nimlēglēg wa nōwōl tit hin̄yeg vēhte. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Nivit del hag alge en, tisisisgoy qēt, wa Ḡod tak vel haphap hag alge en kēy tiyiyeg qēt.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 13:10, Isaiah 34:4</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Tō mahē nen nisil qoyo et Ēntēn Net nihēw me tiwag mi namlēg, mi naman liwo, wa mi nēlēn̄as liwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Tō kē qoyo vētleg ige in̄sel nonon walēg namyam. Tō ige in̄sel tēvēl me ige sil vel vōnō del walēg namyam, a Ḡod mal etyak vatag kēy.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tateh et nēglal nōqōn̄ nan so n̄ēh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Nētētēnge a nayay, kē nivatne kimi qelegēn, mahē nayon nihēwhēw qēt tō so niqtēg taw natawhēn en, tō kimi ēglal so mahē ne ōm̄ōm̄ tēqē nonmi ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Nage nan qelegēn, mahē kimi et vel haphap gōh nivan me en, tō kimi ēglal so Ēntēn Net sisqet nivan me, ba kē nitig sisqet vatag namte-ēm̄. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Hēyhēywē, nok vap van hiy kimi so ige mey n̄ēh togtōkē, kēy tit mat qēt vēhte, gaydēn̄ a nage gōh nivan me. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Ḡod tak qelen̄ alge wa antan, ba nohohole mino tit qelen̄ vēhte.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atmi etgoy galsi kimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Tateh et niēglal so Ēntēn Net so nivan lok me lelo vēvēh wa lahan qōn̄. Ēntēn Net wa ige in̄sel hag alge en, kēy et ēglal te nōqōn̄ nan. Imam Ḡod mahgen nēglal nōqōn̄ nan. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Atmi etgoy galsi kimi, ba tēytēymat vaga, veg kimi et ēglal te so kē tavan me n̄ēh. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kimi so tēymat, qeleso net vitwag nitatal n̄a lepnō tegha. Am̄ag den kē niukēg veteg nēm̄ nonon en, kē mōm̄ōk vel haphap nonon van hiy ige yowyowveg nonon, tō ikēy del en namgumgu namuy aē. Ba kē mavap van hiy net betetgoy mete-ēm̄ en so, ‘Nēk etetgoy galgalsi.’ <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Tō qeleanen, kimi so etgoy galgalsi kimi, veg kimi et ēglal te so welan ne ēm̄ tavan lok me n̄ēh. Kē wun tavan lok me lemyēpyep, lētnētnēqōn̄, mahē nututu nikokyet, siso nalo nihalyak. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Sowo nethap, kē tavan lok ēgē me hiy kimi, tō kē nietvan a kimi nemtimtiy taq qēt. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ba nohohole a nok vap vētday tō van hiy kimi gōh en, nok vap se van hiy nisil del, ‘!Atmi etetgoy!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ige lililwo non ige Tisrael nemyōs so wuh mat Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Nōqōn̄ togoy vōyō se en, tō Negengen Yowlege niqtēg, tiwag mi Nōqōn̄ Liwo Begengen Nēbrēyt a Nis Tateh Alon En. Tō ige m̄agoy ige pris, tiwag mi ige vatvatgo Bele, kēy soksok namtehal so vētleg net so van tēy me Tigsas tō kēy wuh mat kē. Ba kēy nemyōs so ak lōn̄veg ēwē namtehal nan, <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />veg kēy vap so, “Gēn tit ak vēhte legengen liwo, veg ige sil tiple vēhyuw mi gēn aē.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nalqōvēn vitwag mōlōwyeg nēbēqōnqōn lēqtēn Tigsas n̄a Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ba Tigsas hagtō n̄a Betani, a lēm̄ non net vitwag Simon, a nēwēyēs maqal tō kē am̄ag. Ba mahē Tigsas nigengen nen wah, nalqōvēn vitwag nivan me, kē nētēy nōwōbē a kēy magaleg mi nevet, nahan alabasta. Ba nēbēqōnqōn gōh, kēy mak mi nad, a nōqōnqōn lēs. Ba nēsēm nan a nilwo telen̄len̄. Mahē Tigsas gengen lapgetō wah, nalqōvēn nan mihig m̄ōlō namte wōbē nan tō nilōwyeg nēbēqōnqōn nan n̄a lēqtēn Tigsas, veg nalqōvēn nan nēdēmap Tigsas.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ba woqse et den kēy moboel nalqōvēn nan en, tō kēy hohole mahgey so, “?Bahap tō kē mak bon̄bon̄ nēbēqōnqōn gōh? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />!So kē ten̄yeg tō nēbēqōnqōn nen en, togtō kē tētēy nēsēm nan a nilwo telen̄len̄. Tō kē temyin̄ vēh ige m̄asay aē. Veg nēbēqōnqōn nen, haytēyēh so net nimgumgu veg bēte vitwag wonwon!” Tō kēy hole boel kē aē.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi nitog hohole hiy nalqōvēn en, kē mak nahap mey nēwē yeh hiy no. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ige m̄asay notogtog vaga mi kimi. So kimi wo nemyōs en, yatkel mahē ēwē kimi temyin̄ vēh kēy. Ba veg no en, no tit tog misin vēhte mi kimi. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Nalqōvēn gōh mak nage ēwē hiy no a kē tagaleg vēh. Kē mōlōwyeg nēbēqōnqōn gōh me lataqn̄ik so ak tēytēymat betvitvig no. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nok vap van hiy kimi nēhēyhēywē, vel vōnō del lemyam, kēy toyon̄teg noyoy ēwē veg no, tō kēy toyon̄teg se nakaka veg nalqōvēn gōh bege a kē mak tō hiy no en, tō kēy tēdēm lok kē aē vaga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas men̄yeg Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Tō Judas Iskariot, vitwag den ige tin̄qoy son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō; kē mavan me hiy ige m̄agoy ige pris so niak tēytēymat namtehal so niukēg Tigsas van lemney. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Kēy moyon̄teg nohohole non Judas en, tō kēy memlaklak aē a nēkēkēn. Tō kēy mavatvat van hiy kē so wēl kē aē. Tō Judas nimyōs goy tō nisok namtehal ēgēn, so niukēg Tigsas van lemney.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas megengen tiwag mi ige nonon a Lōqōn̄ Yowlege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Nōqōn̄ a kēy meqtēg Nōqōn̄ Liwo Begengen Nēbrēyt a Nis Tateh Alon En,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nōqōn̄ liwo a ige Juw ōl so Nōqōn̄ Liwo Begengen Nēbrēyt a Nis Tateh Alon En, kēy tatagoy nōqōn̄ liviyō. Tō nōqōn̄ totogyeg nan, kēy ōl so Negengen Yowlege. </char></note> lōqōn̄ nen ige sil wuh nisipsip susu Begengen Yowlege. Tō ige non Tigsas mēvēhge van hiy kē so, “?Nēk nemyōs so kemem van so tēytēymat natno Gengen Yowlege ave?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Tigsas mavap van hiy yoge yowyowveg nonon so, “Atmōyō van n̄a lepnō liwo, ba natm̄an vitwag tetsas qiyig kōmyō. Kē neywu natno haha bē liwo. Atmōyō dam kē. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Kē so nihayveg hay lēm̄ vitwag en, tō kōmyō hole tiwag mi net benon ēm̄ nan. Tō vēhge tow kē so, ‘?Vatgo mēvētleg kamyō me so vēhge nēk so, ave mahē a nēk mal tēymat vatag hiy kē so kē nigengen Yowlege tiwag mi ige nonon aē ōk?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Tō net nan telep kōmyō van lidin liwo n̄a alge, vētmahē nan mal tēymat nowmat. Ba atmōyō ak tēytēymat negengen nagangēn begengen liwo mahē anen.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Tō Tigsas nivētleg kōyō ēgēn. Kōyō hatig tō van lepnō liwo en, ba kōyō met vel haphap a qele Tigsas mavap tō van hiy kōyō en. Tō kōyō ak tēytēymat nahaphap del Begengen Yowlege ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavasemlō so Judas qoyo ukēg kē van hiy ige tavale nonon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Nalo niyoy en, tō Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō, kēy van me lēm̄ nan ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Tō kēy mahag walēg natno gengen nen tō kēy gengen. Ba Tigsas mavap so, “Nok vap hēyhēywē van hiy kimi. Vitwag den kimi tukēg no van lemnen ige tavale mino. Vitwag den kimi a gēn gengen tiwag tō agōh.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Tō ige tin̄qoy mololwon hiy kē aē, ba kēy vēvēhge vivitwag Tigsas so, “?Wō ihē? ?Ino?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Ikē vitwag den kimi son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō. Ikē mey a mēqēl nēbrēyt livinlah tiwag mi no. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ēntēn Net tamat qele Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap tō aē. Ba nivipdeg liwo taqal net a kē mukēg Ēntēn Net van lemnen ige tavale nonon en. Nitiy wē yeh so net nen tit wot te me lemyam agōh.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas megengen babah negi tiwag mi ige nonon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Mahē a Tigsas tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy nonon gengen nen wah, Tigsas nilep nēbrēyt. Tō kē mēvēwē bah Ḡod aē en, tō nitōq woy. Tō melep van hiy ige nonon, ba nivap so, “Atmi lep. Igōhkē nataqn̄ik.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Tō Tigsas melep nivinlah waen vitwag, tō mēvēwē bah Ḡod aē en, tō nihog van hiy kēy, tō kēy del in. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Tō Tigsas mavap so, “Igōhkē naday mino, so niak nakavanan non Ḡod tiwag mi ige et nonon nitig maymay. Naday mino nilon̄ so nivaēh woqse et. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Hēywē a hēywē, no vap van hiy kimi so no tit in lok vēhte nawaen gaydēn̄ lōqōn̄ mey a nok in nawaen gayaq lemyeyen talge non Ḡod.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Tō kēy me se bah neh en, tō kēy kalō, tō van n̄a Wutwut Ne Olif.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas mavasemlō am̄ag so Pita tavap so kē et ēglal te Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi del tisisgoy, veg Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so, ‘No tuwuh net betetgoy sipsip, tō ige sipsip teslen̄ vivitwag.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ba mahē a nok ēh lok den namatmat en, tō nok van ba dēyē kimi n̄a Kalili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Tō Pita mavap van hiy Tigsas so, “Wun kēy del tisisgoy, ba nok tit sisgoy vēhte.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy Pita so, “Hēywē a hēywē, no vap van hiy nēk so qiyig anqōn̄ gōh, a nututu et kokyet vagyō qete en, nēk titiayak no vagtēl so nēk et ēglal te no.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ba Pita mavap maymay den am̄ag van hiy Tigsas so, “So no wo mamat tiwag mi nēk en, ba no tit tiayak vēhte nēk.” Tō kēy del mavap qēt qeleanen.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas matatay n̄a Kētsēmēnē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Tigsas tiwag mi ige nonon mavan me mahē vitwag nahan Kētsēmēnē. Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Atmi hag qōtō me agōh, ba nok van tatay.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Tō Tigsas melep Pita, Jemes ba e Jon, kēy mavan. Ba nēdēmdēm nonon mowontig kē veg kē nololwon meh. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy itēlge so, “Nēdēmdēm wa nololwon mino et haytēyēh te, yipteg so nok mat aē.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Tigsas mohole bah en, tō kē nivan den kēytēl, ba et yeh tē, tō kē niyowtaq hōw lēvētan tō nitatay. Kē mēvēhge van hiy Ḡod sowo tak vēh, ukēg nememeh gōh tit qal te kē. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Tigsas mavap so, “Imam, nēk tak vēh vel haphap del. Ba nēk lepyak nivinlah bememeh gōh den no. Ba no qoyo ak nahap te a nēk nemyōs so nok ak. Ba et lemyōs mino te, ba lemyōs nōnōm vēlēs.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Tigsas mavan lok me hiy kēytēl en, ba kēytēl mal mitimtiy. Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy Pita wo, “?Pita, nēk nemtiy? ?Nēk tit matyak vēhte natkelgi? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Kēmtēl nitog mitimtiy ba etgoy galgalsi, wa tatay, veg kēmtēl tiple sisgoy lem̄eygal. Hēywē, nēdēmdēm non mētēl namaymay ba nataqn̄i mētēl nem̄geygey.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Tō Tigsas mavan lok, ba kē matatay lokse qele a kē matatay tō en. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Mahē Tigsas mavan lok me hiy kēytēl en, kēytēl mal mitiy lokse veg nataqn̄ēytēl mal dēw bamatmayge. Tō kēytēl et ēglal te so vulu goy Tigsas qeleave.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Tō Tigsas mavan lokse, tō me atgiy, kē nivan lokse me vagtēl negi. Tō kē nivap van hiy kēytēl so, “?Eh, kēmtēl mitiy m̄ōkheg laptō? Ba mabah ēgēn, veg nalo nan mal van me. Ige gengenyeg so lep Ninti Et, veg net vitwag so niukēg no lemnen ige tavale mino. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Sowle, hatig tō gēn van, veg net nan van vatag me anen.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige tavale mētēy maymay Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Tigsas hohole laptō en, tō Judas nidēn̄ me. Judas gōh, ikē vitwag den ige son̄wul nanm̄e vōyō non Tigsas. Woqse sil madam me Judas, a kēy nētēy geh nagasel bepgal wa naqyēn̄ nonoy. Ige a mēvētleg me ige vagapgal en, ikēy ige pris lililwo, tiwag mi ige vatvatgo Bele, wa ige tamatmayge a kēy tigtig helem̄ag ige Tisrael. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />(Vētmahē a kēy vanvan me so tēy Tigsas en, Judas mal vap nowmat van hiy nisil so, “Nok so mōpōpōn net vitwag en, Tigsas anen. Atmi tēy maymay kē ba lep yak kē.”) <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Judas mēdēn̄ me mahē nen en, tō kē nivan togolgol van hiy Tigsas, tō mavap van hiy kē so, “Vatgo.” Tō kē nipōpōn kē. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Tō kēy van me tō tēy maymay Tigsas.<verse eid="MRK 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ba net vitwag a tig sisqet tō Tigsas en, kē melep nagasel bepgal nonon, wa nitot yak tekel dēln̄an neslev vitwag non Nipris Liwo.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy kēy so, “Kimi mavan me gōh nētēy qēt nagasel bepgal wa naqyēn̄, so tēy no. Ba ino et net buwuwuh mat et te. <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ino navanvan tiwag mi kimi velqōn̄ Lēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod, nok vatvatne kimi, ba kimi et tēy te no. Ba nahaphap a kimi ak gehtō nen en, kē niak tig nohohole Layapyap Yon̄.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Tō ige nonon mukēg Tigsas, tō kēy siksikyak qeleqlen̄ den kē. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ba nōlōmgep vitwag matatag lap Tigsas, net gōh kē namalmal ēwē. Ba ige vagapgal mētēy kē, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ba kē mukēg namalmal nonon, tō niplag a tateh malmal mi kē.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige lililwo non ige Tisrael mitil Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ige vagapgal melep Tigsas van hiy Nipris Liwo. Tō ige lililwo goy ige pris tiwag mi ige tamatmayge a kēy tigtig helem̄ag ige Tisrael, wa ige vatvatgo Bele en, kēy mal hag tiwag nowmat. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Ba Pita matatag me Tigsas, ba kē et van sisqet te kē van. Pita matatag Tigsas tō mēdēn̄ me lidindin a lēm̄ liwo nonon Nipris Liwo. Ige betetgoy mahē nen, kēy mahag walēg nep. Tō Pita nihag tiwag mi kēy so nim̄hil temun kē.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ige pris lililwo tiwag mi nēvēwti mayanag a kēy ōl so Sanhedrin en, kēy soksok net vōyō so tin̄ yak te hohole veg Tigsas, veg kēy nemyōs so wuh mat kē. Ba kēy et etsas te. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Woqse et magalyak hag, ba nohohole nonoy netegtegha geh. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Ba yatkelgi den kēy mitig ketket, ba magal yak nohohole veg Tigsas qelegēn so, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Kemem moyon̄teg Tigsas mavap so, ‘Nēm̄ Bolol non Ḡod gōh a ige et mētēy tō en, no tak hethet. Ba no tētēy kal mey negyaq, bōqōn̄ vētēl ēwē a net et ak te tō.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Kēy mohole qelenen, ba nohohole nonoy et haytēyēh geh te, netegtegha vēlēs.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ba Nipris Liwo mitig ketket van lēvētnay, tō kē mavap van hiy Tigsas wo, “?Bahap tō nēk et vulu goy te kēy? ?Ba qeleave bevel hohole a kēy vēvēg tō nēk aē en?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ba Tigsas mitig yoyon̄, kē et vulu goy te kē. Tō Nipris Liwo gōh mēvēhge lokse van Tigsas wo, “?Qeleave, wō inēk Kraēs? ?Inēk Ēntēn Ḡod a gēn mogmogo goy tō kē gōh?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Tigsas meplu goy kē van wo, “O-oh, ino Kraēs. Kimi qoyo et Ninti Et, a nahag lemtō non Ḡod a kē naman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 110:1</char></note> Ba kē qoyo kalō me den namlēg hag lōtōk en.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Daniel 7:13</char></note>”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Tō Nipris Liwo nen mololgagay a nēkēkēn, tō nihay namalmal nonon, tō mavap so, “?Bahap tō gēn soksok se nohohole non ige tegha? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Kimi mal yon̄teg qēt. Kē mohohole hethet hiy Ḡod anen. Atmi dēmdēm tow aē. ?Tō gēn tak qeleave hiy net gōh?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Tō kēy vēvēg Tigsas, ba mavap so, “Wuh mat kē.”<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Tō yatkelgi den kēy hatig hag tō nihgeg kē. Yatkelgi mom̄ongoy namtan, tō lem̄eh kē, tō kēy vap so, “Inēk net lēgēlgēg non Ḡod, nēk vasem tow. ?Hē lem̄eh tō nēk en?” Tō ige vagapgal lem̄eh kē ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita vap so kē et ēglal te Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pita mahag a lidindin ne ēm̄, tō nam̄alm̄al qan̄qan̄yis nonon Nipris Liwo en nivan me. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Nam̄alm̄al nan met van Pita m̄ihilhil tō a sili ep. Tō kē met galsi van hiy Pita tō mavap so, “Ēy, inēk se tiwag mi nage Tanasaret a Tigsas.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ba Pita mavaleh kē, ba mavap so, “Nok et ēglal hōn te nahap a nēk hole tō aē anen.” Tō Pita nivan yow lemtegeay ēgēn. Tō nututu nikokyet.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Nam̄alm̄al nan met lokse Pita en, tō kē mavap van hiy ige a tig sisqet tō kē en so, “Net nen, ikē vitwag den kēy.”<verse eid="MRK 14:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ba Pita mavap lokse so kē et ēglal te Tigsas. Me atgiy yatkel et tig sisqet tō Pita en, kēy vap van hiy kē so, “O-oh, inēk tiwag mi Tigsas, veg nēk hohole qele ige Takalili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ba Pita mohole mi namaymay so, “!Ḡod tivipdeg no aē sowo nok galgal! !Nok et ēglal hōn te net a nēk hole gatay kē en!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Togolgol mahē nen en, nututu nikokyet lokse vagyō negi. Tō Pita nidēmlok nohohole non Tigsas a kē mavap tō a so, “Mahē a nututu et kokyet vagyō qete en, nēk tavap vagtēl so nēk et ēglal te no.” Tō Pita mololwon aē a nēkēkēn, tō kē niten̄.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Paelat nihohole van hiy Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />A lemtap qōn̄qōn̄ laptō, nēvēwti mayanag non ige Tisrael yōstiwag. Ikēy en ige pris lililwo, tiwag mi ige vatvatgo Bele, ige tamatmayge, wa ige del a kēy Sanhedrin. Kēy movonm̄ēt how so wuh mat Tigsas. Tō ige nan mēlēg maymay namnen Tigsas. Tō kēy van tēy kē me tō m̄ōk kē van lemnen Paelat, net liwo non ige Torom.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Tō Paelat mēvēhge Tigsas wo, “?Wō inēk namyanag non ige Juw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Tigsas meplu goy kē van so, “O-oh, qele a nēk vap en.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Tō ige pris lililwo mitil Tigsas bahaphap a nam̄adeg. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Ba Paelat mavap lokse van hiy Tigsas so, “Ige gōh mitil nēk bohohole a nam̄adeg. ?Qeleave tō nēk et vulu goy te kēy?” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ba Tigsas et hole hōn te. Tō Paelat mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paelat mēdēmm̄ēt aē so Tigsas nimat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Vel ēte a Legengen Yowlege en, net liwo non ige Torom tukēg lō vēh net vitwag so nikalō den nēm̄ yētyēt. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Lamahē nen, yatkel et notogtog lēm̄ yētyēt veg kēy muwuh tō net a lēvēygēl liwo vitwag, ba net vitwag tiwag mi kēy, nahan Barabas. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ba nisil mavan me hiy Paelat so kē nileplō net vitwag den nēm̄ yētyēt, qele kē nigaleg vel ēte en.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Tō Paelat mēvēhge kēy so, “?Kimi nemyōs so nok leplō namyanag non ige Juw?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Veg Paelat mal ēglal vatag so ige pris lililwo mētēy Tigsas veg kēy meqneg wolwol Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ba ige pris lililwo mal vap nowmat van hiy nisil so kēy vēhge Paelat so kē niukēg lō Barabas, ba et Tigsas te. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Tō Paelat mēvēhge nisil so, “?Ba no tak qeleave veg net gōh, a kimi ōl kē so namyanag non ige Juw en?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Tō nisil magayka so, “!Wos kē lowolwol!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Ba Paelat mavap van hiy nisil so, “!No tit wuh mat vēhte Tigsas! !Kē et ak hōn te nahap mey nehet!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Ba nisil magayka liwo malig se hag, “!Wos kē lowolwol!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Ba Paelat nemyōs so niak muhuy nisil, tō kē niukēg lō Barabas. Tō Paelat nivap van hiy ige vagapgal nonon so kēy lem̄eh bah Tigsas en, tō qoyo wos kē lowolwol ēgēn.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige vagapgal melm̄eh Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Ige vagapgal Torom mavan tēy Tigsas n̄a lēm̄ liwo ne kapman, ōl so Praetorium, tō kēy vētleg goy ige vagapgal del tō kēy van me ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Tō Kēy meheygoy Tigsas mi namalmal a nahalme bemyanag. Tō kēy molom walēg niwti wolkokon̄ay tō kēy hey hag lēqtēn Tigsas qele nēvēglal bemyanag. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Tō ige vagapgal yēyēheg Tigsas. Ba kēy mavap so, “!Kemem nēdēmap nēk, mayanag non ige Juw!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Tō kēy lem̄eh nēqtēn Tigsas mi nēqētēnge. Ba kēy minihgeg Tigsas. Tō kēy taqlun̄ how lēvētan a lengon Tigsas, qele a so net nitaqlun̄ goy namyanag. Tō kēy boyheg Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ba mahē a ige vagapgal moboyboyheg bah Tigsas en, tō kēy heylō lok namalmal halme den kē, ba hey lok van namalmal nonon. Tō kēy van tēy Tigsas lēvētmahē a kēy so wos kē aē en.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige vagapgal wos Tigsas lowolwol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Tō ige vagapgal metsas net vitwag so niywu nowolwol non Tigsas. Net nan nivanvan lok me den tekel vōnō, ikē nahan Simon, a nage Tasayrine, kē imam nonon Aleksanda ba Rufus. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Tō kēy van tēy Tigsas me Ḡolkata. Ḡolkata, nēdēmdēm nan so “Natno Qētmat.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Tō ige vagapgal melep van hiy Tigsas nawaen a nēlēy mi nigli qētēnge, a kēy ōl so mir, so niak veteg ne memeh den kē, ba Tigsas et in hōn te. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Tō ige vagapgal wos Tigsas lowolwol. Tō kēy masēg namalmal nonon Tigsas, bastō kēy suwsuwyeg natays aē tō so ēglal so hē telep vēh nahan malmal. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Kēy mowos Tigsas lelo levevet a lemtap.<verse eid="MRK 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ba Paelat mayap nayapyap vēglal gōh so nivasemlō so kēy mēvēvēg Tigsas bahap. Kē mayap so “Net gōh namyanag non ige Juw.” Tō ige vagapgal mōm̄ōk hag lowolwol n̄a apwo qētēn Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Tō kēy mowos se yoge vōyō batan̄tan̄hephep laqaqayan Tigsas, vitwag lemtō ba vitwag legla. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Igōhkē mak tig Nayapyap Yon̄ a mavap so, “Kēy mōm̄ōk Kraēs tiwag mi ige gengenyeg.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yatkel yapyap tam̄ag a lagatgat Krik en, neves 28 gōh tateh alon en.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 53:12</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Ba ige a vanvan geh tō metehal en, kēy hohole hethet hiy Tigsas, wa kēy ququleg nēqtēy. Tō kēy mavap so, “!Igēn! Nēk vap so nēk tak sisgoy vēh Nēm̄ non Ḡod bastō vētgiy kal lok mey negyaq bōqōn̄ vētēl ēwē. <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />!Vaēh nēk mahge ba hēw tēqēl me den nowolwol!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ba ige pris lililwo tiwag mi ige vatvatgo Bele vey boyboyheg Tigsas. Kēy mavap so, “!Kē mavaēh tō yatkel et, ba kē tit vaēh lok vēhte kē! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Itōk so Kraēs, a Namyanag non ige Tisrael, nihēw me den nowolwol, tō gēn so et wa dēmtig kē.” Ba yoge a dam sisqet tō laqaqayan Tigsas en mavap hethet temuyō se hiy Tigsas.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas nimat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Mahē mavan hōw a magayvegsil, a vel vōnō del en, ba a lēlwomyen lapgetō. Mahē memlēglēg qelenen bawa vētēl. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Tō lelo vētēl en, Tigsas mōlōl liwo so, “?Eloi, Eloi, lema sabaktani?” Nēdēmdēm nan so, “?Ḡod mino, Ḡod mino, bahap tō nēk mukēg veteg no qele gōh?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 22:2</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ba ige mey a nitig sisqet Tigsas en, kēy moyon̄teg nohohole gōh, tō kēy vap so, “Atmi yon̄teg. Kē niōlōl Elisa anen.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Tō net vitwag nigityak tō nilep nokoten, mōlōwyeg nawaen gon van nokoten. Tō mēlēg maymay nokoten van lēqētēnge hoyo, tō hog kal hag hiy Tigsas so kē ni-in, tō kē mavap so, “Makōh tow. Gēn et so Elisa tavan me telepyak Tigsas den nowolwol, si tateh.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ba Tigsas magayka a nilwo tō kē nim̄ōkheg m̄ēt.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Togolgol a mahē Tigsas mamat en, namalmal a nadam goy nidin a nitiy yon̄ lawlaw hay Lēm̄ non Ḡod en, memhay aē vōyō, meqtēg alge tō mēdēn̄ n̄a antan. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ba net liwo goy ige vagapgal nitig togolgol a lengon Tigsas, kē met galgalsi a Tigsas mamat en. Tō kē mavap so, “!Hēywē, net gōh, ikē Ēntēn Ḡod!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ba yatkel lōqōvēn mitig a suvay yeh, ba kēy etet van hiy Tigsas. Ige nan wa Mere Tamakdala, Salome, tiwag mi Mere, a ikē tita nonon Jemes su kōyō Joses, ige gōh tig geh tō mahē anen. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ige lōqōvēn gōh matatag tō Tigsas n̄a Kalili. Kēy memyin̄ tō Tigsas bahaphap del. Ba woqse lōqōvēn tegtegha se madam tō Tigsas me Jerusalem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jōsēp metvig Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Tigsas mamat lōqōn̄ Tēvēlēm, ba nōqōn̄ gōh, nōqōn̄ tēytēy mat vel haphap del, veg talōw nan hag en, Nōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg. Nēvēnan ige Juw so tivig net vitwag nōqōn̄ tenenen a kē nimat, ba nalo mal van tēqēl a lōqōn̄ Tēvēlēm. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Veg bege gōh, net vitwag nemyōs so nitvig nowmat Tigsas. Ikē Jōsēp, nage Taramatia, wa ikē net liwo lakansēl Sanhedrin. Ba ikē net vitwag se a kē nemyōs kokoym̄eg so niet namyeyen talge non Ḡod. Tō kē et mētēgteg te, tō mavan togolgol hiy Paelat, tō mēvēhge kē so nilep nataqn̄ēn Tigsas. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Mahē a Paelat moyon̄teg so Tigsas mal mat en, kē mamamakē aē. Tō Paelat mōlōl me net liwo goy ige vagapgal, tō mēvēhge kē so, “?Wō hēywē so Tigsas mal mat?”<verse eid="MRK 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Tō net bepgapgal nan mavap van hiy Paelat so, “O-oh, Tigsas mal mat.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:45">Paelat moyon̄teg qele gōh en, tō kē niukēg van hiy Jōsēp so nilep nataqn̄ēn Tigsas ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Tō Jōsēp mēwēl namalmal a newenwen. Tō kē nilep tēqēl nataqn̄ēn Tigsas, ba m̄ongoy galsi nataqn̄ēn mi namalmal nan. Tō Jōsēp nim̄ōk bat Tigsas hay lelo qayan̄ vet a net et en lō qete me am̄ag. Naqyan̄ vet gōh Jōsēp migil tō a wotō. Tō Jōsēp nitatwulgoy namte qayan̄ nan mi nevet liwo. Ak tō so net tegha tit hayveg vēhte lelo qayan̄.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Ba Mere Tamakdala, tiwag mi Mere a tita nonon Joses, kōyō netgeh mahē a kēy mōm̄ōk bat Tigsas aē en.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Ḡod mak ēh lok Tigsas den namatmat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Nōqōn̄ M̄ōkheg mabah a Layavēg lemyēpyep, tō Mere Tamakdala, tiwag mi Mere a tita nonon Jemes, ba Salome, kēytēl mēwēl yatkel yētēnge qōnqōn so m̄ōk lataqn̄ēn Tigsas tō so nataqn̄ēn niwēwē lap. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Tō taval meyen nan hag en, Lasante a lemtap qōtō, kēytēl mavan me mahē a kēy mōm̄ōk tō Tigsas aē en, ba nalo qoyo halyak ēwē tō. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Kēytēl vanvan me metehal nen, kēytēl vēy hohole so “?Ihē temyin̄ qiyig dētēl so tatwul yak nevet den namte qayan̄?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kēytēl hohole qele gōh veg nevet nan nilwo meh. Ba kēytēl et hag qele kē, net mal tatwul yak nevet nan. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Kēytēl mahayveg hay leqyan̄ nen en, tō kēytēl et van qele kē nōlōmgep vitwag hagtō tekel qayan̄ a lemtō. Kē nehey namalmal hoyo, a naqagqag. Tō kēytēl mamamakē aē a nēkēkēn.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Tō net nan mavap van hiy kēytēl so, “Atmētēl tog mamakē. No nēglal so kēmtēl soksok Tigsas Tanasaret a kēy mowos tō kē lowolwol, ba kē mal hatig lokse. Kē tateh gōh. Atmētēl van me ba et, igōhkē mahē a kēy mōm̄ōk tō kē aē en. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Atmētēl van ēgē hiy ige tin̄qoy nonon tiwag mi Pita. Ba vasemlō van hiy kēy so kē nivanvan m̄ag Kalili. Tō kimi qoyo van ba et kē mahē anen, qele a kē mavap tō van hiy kimi am̄ag.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Tō kēytēl kalō, tō valag veteg naqyan̄ nen, veg kēytēl memtēgteg ba mihiyey aē. Tō kēytēl et vasem hōn te hiy net vitwag en, veg kēytēl memtēgteg yeh.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mere Tamakdala met Tigsas <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mere Tamakdala met Tigsas </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Layapyap tam̄ag lagatgat Krik, mahē kēy mayap Noyoy Ēwē a Mak mayap en, natvēlgi son̄wul tiwag nanm̄e levete (16), kē nibah mi nagaytegi levetēl (16:8). Nohohole alon 16:9-20 tateh alon en. Ba net tegha mayap nagaytegi 16:9-20, tō mōm̄ōk tiwag atgiy.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Mahē Tigsas mēh lokse den namatmat Lasante a lemtap qōtō en, kē maklō kē am̄ag hiy Mere Tamakdala. Mere gōh a Tigsas mōvōylō tō nuvu het liviyō den kē en. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Mere met bah Tigsas en, tō kē nivan niet ige nonon Tigsas ēgēn, ba kēy nahag lolwon wa ten̄ geh tō nen. Tō Mere ta Makdala nivasem van hiy kēy noyoy gōh ēgēn. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kēy moyon̄teg noyoy nen a so Tigsas mahatig lok den namatmat, wa Mere mal etsas Tigsas, ba kēy et dēmtig te nohohole nonon.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoge yowyowveg nonon met Tigsas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Me atgiy en, Tigsas maklō kē van hiy yoge vōyō nonon mahē kōyō mavan me den lepnō liwo vitwag, tō kōyō vanvan tatag namtehal. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Tō kōyō m̄ōl lok me, tō vasemlō noyoy gōh van hiy ige nonon Tigsas yatkelgi, ba kēy et dēmtig te kōyō.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tigsas maklō kē van hiy ige hal nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vitwag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Me atgiy lokse, Tigsas makalō me hiy ige nonon son̄wul nanm̄e vitwag, mahē a kēy gengen. Tō Tigsas nihole maymay van hiy kēy veg kēy et dēmtig te ige mey a met tō kē, a so kē mahatig lokse den namatmat. Kē mavap so nēqtēy namaymay veg kēy et dēmtig te. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Tō Tigsas mavap van hiy ige nonon so, “Kimi van vel vōnō del lemyam ba vasemlō noyoy ēwē van hiy nisil del lemyam. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ihēte a nēdēmtig noyoy ēwē gōh tō nilep navasugyon̄ en, Ḡod tavaēh kē. Ba ihēte a et dēmtig te en, Ḡod tēvēvēg kē, wa tit vaēh vēhte kē. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Tō nēvēglal qelegōh totog tiwag mi ige mēy a nēdēmtig: Kēy tōvōyyak nuvu het lehek. Kēy tohohole mi nagatgat gayaq. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Kēy tētēy nam̄at mey a nin̄itn̄it mat net, ba kēy tit mat vēhte aē. So kēy wo min nage mey nehet, kēy tit yon̄teg vēhte nehet aē. Wa tō kēy tōm̄ōk namney apwon ige gom, tō kēy tēwē lokse.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Sōwlē, mahē Welan Tigsas mohole bah hiy kēy en, tō Ḡod nilep kal kē hag lōtōk ēgēn. Tō Tigsas nihaghiy hōw lemtō non Ḡod.<verse eid="MRK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Tō me atgiy, ige nonon mavan vel vōnō del, tō toytoy noyoy ēwē. Tō Welan memgumgu tiwag mi kēy, wa mak nohohole nonoy mitig maymay qēt mi woqse vahah, so nivasemlō so hohole nonoy en hēyhēywē. Amen.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>